\id JOS  
\h Kutsuhexi 
\toc1 Kutsuhexi 
\toc2 Kutsuhexi 
\toc3 Kuts 
\mt1 Kutsuhexi  
\c 1  
\s1 Yawé Kutsuhexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨa  
\p
\v 1 'Arike Muitsexi 'umɨku Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, Kakaɨyari Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe Nuni nu'aya, Muitsexi mɨparewiekai:  
\v 2 «Nemɨti'aitɨakai Muitsexi kaniumɨni. 'Ayumieme 'ekɨ meta yunaitɨ 'ikɨ teɨteri mekaniyukuha'aritɨakuni memanukɨnekɨ haa Kurutanitsie, meta xemeutahaxɨanikɨ nemɨxeyetuirienitsie kwie xeme 'ixaheritsixi.  
\v 3 Yaxeikɨa kenemɨrehɨawekai Muitsexi, ne nepɨxeyetuirieni naime kemɨ'ane mana xemu'uwanikɨ.  
\v 4 Xekwie 'apɨtayeure, makumawetsie Riwanu paitɨ ye'atɨkaitɨ, meta haa manuyehanetsie paitɨ 'Eupɨrate, hetitsixi wakwietsie, tau makayuyuipike hepatsie haramara Meritexaniyu paitɨ ye'atukaitɨ kanayeimɨkɨ.  
\v 5 Kepaɨmexɨa tukari pemuyeikani xewitɨ pɨkayɨweni matsi'a'iwanikɨ. Mɨpaɨ kenemɨtiuyeikakai Muitsexi hamatɨa yaxeikɨata 'ahamatɨa nepɨtiuyeikani, nepɨkamatsinutuita nepɨkamatsiku'eirieni.   
\p
\v 6 »Kenetɨrɨkaɨyeni meta pepɨkamaka, 'ekɨtsɨ pekatiniyurimɨkɨ 'ikɨ teɨteri wakwie mayani nemɨwaxatɨakai watutsima.  
\v 7 Xeikɨa nepɨmatsiwawirie waɨkawa kene'awaɨriyani kenetseɨyeni 'inɨari niukiyari naime pemaye'atɨanikɨ Muitsexi mɨmatsi'uta'utɨiri. Mɨkɨ pepɨka'iku'e'eiriwani ni'etsiwatɨma, mɨpaɨ xeikɨa pepɨyɨweni tsepa hakewa pemetɨa.  
\v 8 Keneutiterɨwani yuheyemekɨ tsepa kepauka 'inɨari niukiyari maye'uxa, tukarikɨ tɨkarikɨ kɨmana kene'a'iyaritɨaka, naime kenaye'atɨa pe'akweriwayurietɨ kemɨre'uxa, mɨpaɨ tsepa kepemɨti'uximaya yapɨtiyɨni.  
\v 9 Mɨpaɨ nekamatini'aitɨaka: Kenetɨrɨkaɨyeni ketinayu'iwani. Pepɨkamaka kene'awaɨriyani. Yawé 'akakaɨyari pɨmatsiteɨtani tsepa hakewa pemetɨa».   
\p
\v 10 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwaru'aitɨani 'ukirawetsixi teɨteri memɨhɨritɨarie:  
\v 11 «Mɨpaɨ xeketeniwarukahɨawi yunaime 'ena memukutei meke'uyuka'inɨatɨaxɨani, haika tukari 'anukayayu Kurutanitsie tekaniukɨnikuni, kwietsie temɨ'axɨanikɨ Kakaɨyari Yawé mɨtatsiyetuirie tapiini mɨrayanikɨ».   
\p
\v 12 Xuweni nuiwarimama, Kahari xiɨyarimama meta Manatsexi xiɨyarimama hixɨata me'atɨ, Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:   
\p
\v 13 ―Xekenaye'eri kemainekai Muitsexi, Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame: “Xekakaɨyari Yawé kanixe'uka'uxipitɨani kanixeyetuirieni 'ikɨ kwie”.  
\v 14 Xe'ɨitama xeniwema xetewama mana mekaniu'uwakuni Muitsexi mɨxeyetuiritsie Kurutani 'aurie. Peru xeme kuyaxi 'ukitsi xekananukɨnikuni xe'anuyetetɨ yu'iwama wahɨxie. Xekaniwaparewikuni  
\v 15 kepaukake Yawé mɨwaka'uxipitɨani xeme kemɨtixe'uka'uxipitɨa, kepaukake mɨkɨ kwie memɨ'axe Yawé takakaɨyari mɨwayetuiri. 'Anake xeme xepakunuaxɨani yukwietsie mana xemɨtitenikɨ. Mɨkɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni Muitsexi Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame mɨxeyetuirie hatuxame Kurutani 'anutaɨye mukuma tau manatineika hepatsie.   
\p
\v 16 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi mekateniuta'eiya:  
\p ―Tame yatepɨtekakɨne naimekɨ kepemaine, tame tepɨyehu tsepa hakewa pemɨtatsihetanɨ'a.  
\v 17 Naimekɨ yatepɨtekakɨne, Muitsexi ketemɨteheu'eniekai. Tepiwawa xeikɨa Yawé 'ahamatɨa ke'uyeikani Muitsexi hamatɨa kemɨtiuyeikakai.  
\v 18 Kemɨ'ane 'aniuki mɨka'anu'enieni, kemɨ'ane yamɨkatikayani kepemɨtita'aita kanimieriemɨkɨ. Peru 'ekɨ kenetɨrɨkaɨyeni pepɨkamaka.   
\c 2  
\s1 Xahawi meta 'awie nenieremete  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi Nuni nu'aya 'awie kaniwarenɨ'ani yuhutame 'awie nenieremete, Tsitini metitetɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xekenehu kwie xekenexeiyayu, Keriku mɨrakutewatsie». Kepauka Keriku memuta'axɨa 'awie nenieremete, 'ukaratsi tuminikɨ muyumayɨinɨa hetsɨa mekaniu'axɨani mana mekanitiheteitɨni, Xahawi titewakame hetsɨa.  
\v 2 Hikɨ Kerikutsie ti'aitame katinetimani kename yuhutatɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'awienenieremete mɨkɨ tɨkaritsie kiekaritsie me'u'axɨakai mekunieretɨwetɨ.  
\v 3 Hikɨ niuki kanenɨ'ani Xahawi hetsɨa: «Keniwaranuyenɨ'a mɨkɨ teɨteri 'akie memu'axɨa, mɨkɨ 'awie takwie xexeiyamete mekaniyɨaka».   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ 'ukaratsi 'awie nenieremete mɨwaruti'awietakai, ti'aitame mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Puyuri nekie yuhutatɨ mepu'axɨakai, peru 'atsinepɨkatimate kemɨ'ane memɨyɨakai, hakewa memeyekɨnekai.  
\v 5 Mepekɨ kuyɨrirɨmekaku kiekari kitenie reunarirɨmekaku 'atsinepɨkaretima hakewa memekɨ. Xekeniwaranukuweiya heiwatɨ xewaranuku'axe».  
\v 6 (Peru 'ukaratsi mɨkɨ 'ukitsi yukii heima kaniwareutinɨ'akaitɨni, rinu manukuyari hetɨa kaniwaruti'awietakaitɨni, mana mitiwatsiɨxakaitɨa).  
\v 7 Ti'aitame nɨ'arimama mekanekɨne 'awie nenieremete wa'utɨma me'eerietɨ. Kepauka memuwayekɨ Keriku kitenie katineunare, Kurutani tsimatiyeyeu huyeyari 'utɨa mekanekɨne.   
\p
\v 8 Xahawi kananutiyani yukii heima, 'awie nenieremete mekaheukutsiwawekaku 'akuxi.  
\v 9 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p ―Ne mɨpaɨ nepɨtimate Yawé 'ikɨ kwie pɨxeyetuiri, 'ayumieme tame tepɨxemakaxe, teyunaitɨ 'ena kiekatari marikakɨ tepɨkwiximeri 'atepɨka'u'uwanikeyu xehɨxie.  
\v 10 Tepɨtemarie Yawé Haramara Mɨxeta hixɨapa kemɨranuhuyetaxɨ xeme mana hayewakimetsie xemukɨnekɨ, 'Ekipitu xeheyekɨneka. Yaxeikɨatsiere tepɨtemarie te'aitamete kexemɨtewara'iwaxɨ 'amuxeutsixi Tsikuni meta 'Uhuki, Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie.  
\v 11 'Ayumieme tame waɨkawa tepɨxemakaxe, nixewitɨ pɨkayuwaɨriya mɨxetakwini. Ne mɨpaɨ nepɨtimate Yawé yuri Kakaɨyari pɨhɨkɨ, kakaɨyarixi mɨwara'iwa, muyuawitsie meta kwiepa mɨti'aita.  
\v 12 'Ayumieme nepɨxewawirie hikɨ yaxekeneteneutahɨawi Yawé hɨxie, kename tame xetatsitinenimayata ne hikɨ kememɨtixe'utinenimayataxɨ. 'Inɨari xekeneneuwewiri mɨpaɨ nemɨtimaikakɨ  
\v 13 kename ne'paapama xekawakwini meta ne'iwama yunaime wahamatɨa memu'uwa. Yaxekeneutiyua kename xetatsitawikweitsitɨani temɨkakwinikɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Tame yatepaitɨka Yawé hɨxie tatukari teyetuatɨ kename 'atsixekate'anuyekɨne, xɨkatsɨ pekatatsi'utaxaneta tame 'aixɨa tepɨteyurieni 'ahetsiemieme, tepɨtehaye'atɨani ketemaitɨka kepauka Yawé mɨtatsiyetuirieni 'ikɨ kwie.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ Xahawi yukii hixɨapa kaniwaratuani kaunarikɨ, Xahawi kiiya kiekari kuraruyaritsie katiniwekaitɨni.  
\v 16 Meripaitɨri mɨpaɨ pɨtiwarahɨawekai: «Xekeneuyuta'una hɨritsie memɨxe'uweiya memɨkaxetaxeiyakɨ. Mana xekeneyuti'awieta haika tukari, memɨxe'uweiya me'akunuaxɨayuke. 'Anake xekaneyɨwaweni xemeyehukɨ».   
\p
\v 17 'Ukitsi Xahawi mɨpaɨ mekateniutahɨawe:  
\p ―Tepɨtixɨne ketemaitɨka  
\v 18 xɨka, kepauka 'ena temɨ'axɨani xɨka teka'ixeiya 'ikɨ wiwieri mɨxeta 'uwa hawiekame hakewa pemɨtatsiheukatua. Metatsiere 'apaapama 'a'iwama yunaitɨ 'amarema, 'ana 'akiita mekanayetekuni.  
\v 19 Kemɨ'ane muwayeyani mɨkɨ tukaritsie kanimieriemɨkɨ, tame tahetsie pɨkarahɨiyani, tame tepɨwahɨka 'akiita memayeteni xɨka xewitɨ wakwimɨkɨni.  
\v 20 Xɨka petatsi'utaxaneta, tame tepɨxɨne hikɨ ketemutiyua 'ekɨ yapetarahɨawekaku.   
\p
\v 21 Xahawi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p ―Mɨpaɨ kani'anemɨkɨ xeme kexemaitɨka.  
\p Hikɨ kaniwarutateutɨani, mɨkɨ mekanekɨne, mɨkɨta wiwieri mɨxeta yukii hixɨapa kanetapieni.   
\p
\v 22 Mɨkɨ 'ukitsi hɨritsie mekanekɨne mana mekanititekaitɨni haika tukari, kepaukake memɨwaruweiya memakunuaxɨa yukiekaritsie. Naitsarie mekaniwarutiwauni, peru mepɨkawarutaxei.  
\v 23 Hikɨ memuyuhuta mekanakunuaxɨani, hɨritsie mekananakakɨne hapa me'ukɨneka mekaniu'axɨani Kutsuhexi manukatei Nuni nu'aya. Mana mekatenitaxatɨani naime kemɨreyɨ:  
\v 24 «Yawé pɨtatsiyetuiriri mɨkɨ kwie naime. Yunaitɨ teɨteri mekanimamaka metatsixeiyatɨ».   
\c 3  
\s1 Kurutani hatɨayaritsie kememɨte'anukɨ  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ kwi ximeri paitɨ mekanekɨne Tsitini kwieyaritsie meyekɨneka Kutsuhexi meta 'ixaheritsixi Kurutani hatɨayari manuyehanetsie me'eerietɨ, 'akuxi meka'anukɨniwawetɨ mana hatetsita mekaniyuhayewa.  
\v 2 Hairieka tukaritsie 'ukirawetsixi mekaniukakɨne naitsarie memakutekaitsie,  
\v 3 mɨpaɨ me'utiyuatɨ: «Kepauka tɨratu kakuniyari xemɨxeiya Yawé takakaɨyari kemutayɨ meta rewitsixi memitɨxime, 'ana xekenanuku'uti hakewa xemetitei 'utɨana xekeneuhuni.  
\v 4 'Ana mɨpaɨ xepɨtehetimani kexemɨteheuyune, hatsuaku xemɨka'anuyekɨniwawetsie kaniuyeyeimɨkɨ, xeikirumeturuyari heutewakaku 'utɨmana xepuhuni, kwi hurawa xepɨka'ukɨkani».   
\p
\v 5 Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani teɨteri: «Xekeneuyu'iti, 'uxa'a Yawé mariwemekɨ katiniyurimɨkɨ xehɨxie».  
\v 6 Meta mawari wewiwamete mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xekeneutikwe'i tɨratu kakuniyari teɨteri wahɨxie xekenanuyeyaxi». Mawari wewiwamete yamekatenikakɨne mekananuyeyaxe.   
\p
\v 7 Hikɨ Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Hikɨ mɨtiyehane mariweme nepɨmatsi'ayeitɨani 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie. Mɨpaɨ memɨtehetimanikɨ kename 'ahamatɨa ne'uyeika Muitsexi hamatɨa kenemɨtiuyeikakai hepaɨ.  
\v 8 Tawarita mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani mawari wewiwamete tɨratu kakuniyari mematɨkɨ: “Kepauka Kurutani tetsita xemɨkatexɨani, xekaniwa'uikuni”».   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi 'ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Hurawa xekenakɨni nepɨtixetaxatɨani Yawé Kakaɨyari kemaine».  
\v 10 Kutsuhexi tawarita mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Hikɨ mɨpaɨ xepɨtehetimani kename Kakaɨyari mayeniere xehamatɨa 'uyeika, kename yurikɨ wataweiyaxɨani kananeutsixi, hetitsixi, heweutsixi, peretseutsixi, keriketseutsixi, 'amuxeutsixi meta kewutseutsixi.  
\v 11 Naitsarie kwiepa mɨti'aita tɨratuya kakunieya xekanixeiyakuni, Kurutani hatɨayaritsie kananuyeimɨkɨ xehɨxie.  
\v 12 Hikɨ tamamata heimana huta xekeniwaranuyexeiya yuxexuime 'Ixaheri wanuiwaritsie  
\v 13 Kepauka memaka'uni hapa Kurutani hetsie mawari wewiwamete Yawé naitsarie kwiepa mɨti'aita kakunieya memukweixime, haa mana puyuhayewaxɨani ka'uhanetɨ manutanaka hepaɨ».   
\p
\v 14 Kepauka memanuku'ui teɨteri Kurutanitsie me'anukɨneke mawari wewiwamete mekananuyeyaxe tɨratu kakuniyari me'akwetɨ.  
\v 15 Haa Kurutani 'amupaparetsie 'itsanaxa, 'ana 'amemɨte'aka'ui mawari wewiwamete tɨratu kakuniyari memukweixime,  
\v 16 hikɨ haa 'uhanetɨ katiniuhayewa, 'ai hepaɨ 'anetɨ kanayani 'ateewa yuhekɨatɨ, 'Arani kiekariyaritsie kaniuti'ani meta Tsaretani kuraruyari 'amatitewa hepaɨtsita, yaxeikɨata katiniuhayewa 'uhanetɨ Harawa meukayune Haramara Mɨmɨkitsie, mɨpaɨ mekateniukɨne teɨteri 'ixaheritsixi mekaniuyuhayewa Keriku hɨxie.  
\v 17 Hikɨ mawari wewiwamete tɨratu kakuniyari Yawé hetsiemieme memukweiximekai Kurutani hixɨapa mekaniwa'uni, mexi me'anukɨkakai 'ixaheritsixi 'ayewakikakɨ.   
\c 4  
\s1 Tetexi kememɨte'ukayatsaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Kepauka yunaitɨ memanukɨ Kurutani hatɨayaritsie Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\v 2 «Tamamata heimana huta nuiwaritsie yuxexuime xekeniwaranuyexeiya,  
\v 3 mɨpaɨ ketiniwaruta'aitɨa, memititɨkɨkɨ ha'ute tamamata heimana huta haa hixɨapa mieme, hakewa yemekɨ memeti'ukai mawari wewiwamete. Mɨpaɨ xeketeniwarutahɨawi hakewa memetiheni mana mepitiyatsa».   
\p
\v 4 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi kaniwarukuxeɨrieni tamamata heimana huta nuiwaritsie memanayexeiyarie,  
\v 5 Mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xekenehu haa hixɨapa Yawé kakunieya mayekatsie yuxexuitɨ tetexi xekenatɨki. Tamamata heimana huta kanayeimɨkɨ, xexuime 'Ixaheri nuiwarimama kememɨyupaɨme.  
\v 6 Pɨ'inɨaritɨni xehetsiemieme. 'Uxa'atɨniwarie xeniwema mepɨxeta'iwawiya: “¿Titayari 'ena 'ikɨ tetexi tititei?”,  
\v 7 xeme mɨpaɨ xepɨtewatahɨawe: “Kepauka Kurutanitsie makweiyatɨya tɨratu kakuniyari Yawé hetsiemieme. Haa kananutayepiere hixɨapa, 'ikɨ tetexi mɨyamɨretei tame 'ixaheritsixi pɨta'inɨari mɨya mɨtiuyɨtsie mieme”».   
\p
\v 8 'Ixaheritsixi yamekateniuyurieni Kutsuhexi kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ Yawé kemainekai. Tetexi mekaniutitɨkɨ Kurutani hixɨapa mieme, kememɨyupaɨmekai nuiwarite, mematihenitsie mekaneitɨkɨ mana mekanitiyatsa.  
\v 9 Meta Kutsuhexi hakewa mawari wewiwamete memeti'ukai, Kurutani hatɨayari hixɨapa tɨratu kakuniyari memukweiximekai manata tetexi kanitiyatsa tawarita tamamata heimana hutame. Hikɨ 'akuxi mana kanehekɨaka tetexi.   
\p
\v 10 Mawari wewiwamete haa hixɨapa mekaniye'ukaitɨni kakuni memakwekai naime 'aixɨa mete'uyuriekake Yawé Kutsuhexi kemɨrahɨawekai. Mɨpaɨ katiniɨyɨni Muitsexi Kutsuhexi kemɨrahɨawekai. Teɨteri meyumexɨitɨatɨ mekananukɨne.  
\v 11 Yunaitɨ yamete'uyurieku, Yawé kakunieya meta mawari wewiwamete mekananukɨne teɨteri wahɨxie.  
\v 12 Mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa mekanaye'ukaitɨni kuyaxi Xuweni nuiwarimama, Kahari nuiwarimama, Manatsexi nuiwarimama hixɨata me'atɨ, Muitsexi kemɨtiu'aitakai.  
\v 13 Huta tewiyari miriyari (40.000) kuyaxi mekaniuyuka'uitɨani Yawé hɨxie, makuweritsie me'eerietɨ Keriku hepatsie meyutakwinike.   
\p
\v 14 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Yawé Kutsuhexi mariweme kanayeitɨani 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie. Teɨteri Kutsuhexi 'aixɨa mekatenixeiyakaitɨni kemɨreuterixɨ 'uyeikatɨ, Muitsexi kememɨtexeiyakai hepaɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\v 16 «Mɨpaɨ ketiniwaruta'aitɨa tɨratu kakuniyari tɨkɨmete meke'anatikɨne Kurutanitsie».  
\v 17 Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mawari wewiwamete memanatikɨnekɨ,  
\v 18 mɨkɨ mekananatikɨne tɨratu kakuniyari me'akwetɨ. Kepauka wakikɨa memɨti'ui, haa kananuyeyeurieni, 'uhanetɨ kanayani hutarieka.  
\v 19 Mexɨakame metseritsie tamamata tukaritsie, 'ixaheritsixi mekananukɨne Kurutanitsie Kirikari rakutewakaku mekanikuyaxe, Keriku tau manatineikatsie 'aurie.  
\v 20 Hikɨ mana Kutsuhexi katiniwaruta'aitɨani mana tetexi memɨtiyatsakɨ Kurutani haa hixɨapa mematitɨkixɨ 'ayewakikaku,  
\v 21 'ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «'Uxa'atɨni warie, xɨka xeniwema mexe'uta'iwawiya: “¿Titayari 'ikɨ tetexi 'ena tititei?”,  
\v 22 xeme mɨpaɨ xepɨtewatahɨawe: “Kepauka 'ixaheritsixi memanakɨ Kurutanitsie wakikɨa mepakɨ”.  
\v 23 Yawé xekakaɨyari, yaxeikɨa pɨtiuyuri Haramara Mɨxeta hetsie kemɨtiuyuri wakikɨa pɨwarawitɨtɨya.  
\v 24 'Ikɨ mɨyapɨtiuyɨ yunaitɨ nuiwarite memɨtehetimanikɨ Yawé mɨmariwe, xeme xemitsutɨanikɨ xeheyemakatɨ yuheyemekɨ xemeyexeiyanikɨ».   
\c 5  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ, te'aitamete waɨkawa mekaniutimamani 'amuxeutsixi Kurutani 'anataɨye tau makayuyuipike hepatsie memɨtamakai, meta kananeutsixi haramara Meritexaniyu tetsita memɨtamakai, kepauka memɨtehetima kename Yawé Kurutani hekawatsiɨxaxɨ mana memukɨnekɨ 'ixaheritsixi. Mepɨkayuwaɨriyakai memɨwatakwinikɨ.   
\s1 Xitekiya kememɨte'uwewiyarie 'ixaheritsixi  
\p
\v 2 'Ana tukaritsie, Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Tete nawaxayari keneutiwewi, xitekiya 'inɨariyari tawarita keneutsutɨa 'ixaheritsixi wahetsie».  
\v 3 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi tete nawaxayari kaniutiwewieni, 'ixaheritsixi xitekiya 'inɨariyari kaniwaruwewirieni 'Araruti yemuriyaritsie.  
\v 4 'Inɨari xitekiyari pɨwaruwewiri 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekipitu memeyekɨnekai kuyakɨ me'aye'atɨarietɨkaitɨ makumawetsie me'uhutɨ memukwikaikɨri.  
\v 5 Mɨkɨ yunaitɨ xitekiya mepexeiyakai, peru me'ayekɨneka 'Ekipitu makumawetsie me'uhukaku memutinunuiwaxɨ mɨkɨ xitekiya mepɨkahexeiyakai.  
\v 6 Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ pɨtiwarahɨawekai watutsima kwie pɨwayetuirienikekai retsi meta xiete maxuawe. Peru 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekipitu memɨyekɨ Yawé mepɨka'anu'eni, 'ayumieme puyuhɨritɨa mɨkawapitɨanikɨ memixeiyakɨ mɨkɨ kwie. 'Ayumieme makumawetsie mepu'uwakai huta tewiyari wiyari, me'ukwikuke yunaitɨ 'ukitsi kuyakɨ memaye'atɨarietɨkatei.  
\v 7 Mɨkɨ waniwema, Kakaɨyari mɨwarupitɨa wahetsiemieme, Kutsuhexi xitekiya 'inɨariyari kaniwaruwewirieni, 'inɨari memɨka'uwewiyariekɨ me'uhutɨ.  
\v 8 Yunaitɨ 'inɨari me'uwewiyarieka memakutekaitsie mekaniyuhayewakaitɨni 'aixɨa memɨteka'erienikɨ.   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «'Ari nepɨxe'uxɨnaxɨ kexemɨteyutetewiyakai waɨriyarika te'uximayatamete xehɨkɨtɨtɨ 'Ekipitu». 'Ayumieme mana Kirikari mepɨte'uterɨwaxɨ, hikɨ 'akuxi mɨpaɨ pɨrakutewa.   
\s1 Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari  
\p
\v 10 Mexɨakame metseritsie tamamata heimana nauka taikaiyaritsie, makuweritsie metitetɨ Keriku 'aurie, 'ixaheritsixi Patsikwa 'ixɨarariyari mekaniuwewieni.  
\v 11 'Uxa'arieka heutipareku 'ixɨarari, teɨteri mekateniutikwani naime kwiepa timieme, paa mɨkakuxanariyarietɨka meta tɨriku xarikiyari.  
\v 12 Mana mɨtiyetɨa manana\f + \fr 5:12 \fq manana\ft . Keneuxeiya \+fr Memeyekɨ 16.\f* kawiwiwetɨ katiniuhayewa, mɨkɨ wiyaritsie 'ixaheritsixi 'ikwaxi mekatenikwakaitɨni kwiepa timieme.   
\s1 Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame Yawé hetsɨa mieme  
\p
\v 13 Merikɨtsɨ Kutsuhexi Keriku 'aurie kaniukateitɨni, kepauka manukunierixɨ xeime tewi kaniuxeiya hɨxiena 'uweme, 'ixipara heukwekame. Kutsuhexi 'ahurawa kaniuyani kanita'iwawiya:  
\p ―¿'Ekɨ petihɨkɨ tahetsɨamieme, nutsutɨ pemɨtatsi'aye'unie pepɨyɨane?   
\p
\v 14 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p ―Nixeime hetsɨa nepɨkamieme. Nepɨnehekɨata 'ahɨxie kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame nehɨkɨtɨtɨ Yawé hetsɨamieme.  
\p Hikɨ Kutsuhexi kaniukahɨximakeni kwiepa mɨpaɨta katinita'iwawiya:  
\p ―¿Tita penetiku'aitɨane neti'aitɨwame? Mati'uximayatsiriwame nepɨhɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Kuyaxi tiwa'aitɨwame Yawé hetsɨamieme mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p ―'Akakai kenanuyehɨnaxɨa, pemanuwetsie kanakupatsieka.  
\p Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katinikayani.   
\c 6  
\s1 Keriku kemɨtiuka'unixɨ  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ Keriku 'aixɨa katinenakaitɨni memanutakɨkatsie kitenie mewamakatɨ 'ixaheritsixi, xewitɨ mɨwayeyani pɨkayɨwekai meta meutahani.  
\v 2 Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Keriku nepɨmatsiyetuiri meta mana ti'aitame metatsiere kuyaximama pemɨwakwinikɨ.  
\v 3 'Ekɨ, meta 'akuyaxima kiekari warita xekenakɨni xeimieme, mɨpaɨ xepɨteyurieka 'ataxewime tukaritsie.  
\v 4 Me'atahutatɨ mawari wewiwamete kuxineta mepɨtihɨtsieni, muxatsi wa'awate pɨhɨkɨtɨni, mepuhuni tɨratu kakuniyari hɨxie. 'Atahuta tukaritsie 'atahutamexɨa xekananakukɨnikuni kiekari warita, mexi mawari wewiwamete mete'utahɨtsiwani.  
\v 5 Kepauka yunaitɨ hɨtsierika memɨ'enieni kuyaxa mieme, 'ana teɨteri karima mepɨtihiwa, 'ana kiekari kuraruyari pɨka'une, hikɨ 'ana yuxexuitɨ mepeutahaxɨani hayekɨa».   
\p
\v 6 Kutsuhexi Nuni nu'aya mawari wewiwamete kaniwaruta'inieni mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani: «Tɨratu kakuniyari Yawé hetsiemieme xekeneutikwe'i, me'atahutatɨta xe'iwama 'awate me'u'ɨtɨ tɨratu kakuniyari hɨxie me'anuyetetɨ».  
\v 7 Hikɨ teɨteri mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xeiya kiekari warita xekenanakukɨni, peru kuyaxi xe'anuyetetɨ Yawé tɨratuya kakuniyari hɨxie xe'uhutɨ».   
\p
\v 8 Kepauka Kutsuhexi yamutayɨ teɨteri yatiwakɨhɨawetɨ, me'atahutatɨ mawari wewiwamete tɨratu kakuniyari Yawé hetsiemieme hɨxie mekanika'uni, mete'utahɨtsiwatɨ tɨratu kakuniyari wa'utɨa kaniukweiyaximekaitɨni.  
\v 9 'Ukitsi mepanuyetekai yutupi me'u'ɨtɨ, mawari wewiwamete kuxineta me'uhɨtsiximetɨ wahɨxie meta tɨratu kakuniyari 'utɨa kuyaxi hutarieka miemete mepuhukai. Mɨkɨ kememɨteheuterixɨ 'awate kuxinetayari hɨtsiwamete mepɨkatehayewakai mexi me'anakukɨkakai.  
\v 10 Kuyaxi yunaime Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani, kayuwatɨ memuhunikɨ meka'utiniutɨ meka'utihiwatɨ kepaukake mɨpaɨ memɨtetahɨawarienikekai karima memɨtihiwakɨ.   
\p
\v 11 Kutsuhexi tɨratu kakuniyari keriku warie mekanakwetɨkɨne heiwamie, hikɨ 'ana teɨteri mekanakunuaxɨani memakuteitsie mana memanukutsukɨ.  
\v 12 'Uxa'arieka ximeripaitɨ Kutsuhexi kananukukeni, mawari wewiwameteta kakuni Yawé tɨratuya mekaniutikweni Yawé hetsɨa mieme.  
\v 13 Me'atahutatɨ mawari wewiwamete 'awate kuxinetayari memu'ɨkai mekananuyeyaxe tɨratu kakuniyari Yawé hetsiemieme hɨxie, 'awate kuxinetayari memuhɨtsixime, 'ukitsi kuyaxi mekananuyetekaitɨni meta tɨratu kakuniyari 'utɨa mekaniuhukaitɨni kuyaxi hutarieka miemete, pɨkatiuhayewaxɨa 'awate kuxinetayari tukarikɨ hayuatɨkaitɨ.  
\v 14 Metatsiere hutarieka tukaritsie xeimie xeikɨa mepakɨ Keriku warita, hikɨ mekaniu'axɨani mematitekaitsie. Mɨpaɨ mepɨte'uyuri 'ataxewime tukaritsie.   
\p
\v 15 'Atahutarieka tukari, tau 'anatinekaku mekananuku'uni, yaxeikɨa kiekari warita mekanakɨne matɨari hepaɨ kememɨyɨakai, peru 'ana 'atahutamexɨa mekananakukɨne.  
\v 16 'Atahutarieka me'anakukɨneke mawari wewiwamete 'awate kuxinetayari mekaniutihɨtsieni, Kutsuhexi kuyaxi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'aitɨani: «Hikɨrixɨa xekeneutihiwa. Yawé kiekari kanixeyetuirieni.  
\v 17 Keriku, naime tita mɨrexeiya naitɨ katineuyehɨiyamɨkɨ, mawari taiyariyari hepaɨ Yawé hetsiemieme. Kanitawikweimɨkɨ xeikɨa 'ukaratsi tuminikɨ muyumayɨinɨa Xahawi meta kemɨ'ane hamatɨana memayeteni kiitana, mɨkɨ 'awie nenieremete tahetsɨa miemete mɨwaruti'awietaxɨkɨ.  
\v 18 Tixaɨtɨ xepɨkatekumaɨwani peuyewetse naime temɨtetitaiyakɨ, kapa tame xeme meta temakutei 'ixaheritsixi 'axamɨti'ane temɨniupitɨarie temɨneuyehɨiya.  
\v 19 Hurukɨ pɨratakɨ meta wurunitsekɨ mɨtiwewiyatɨka meta tepɨakɨ, mɨkɨ Yawé hetsɨa pɨtimieme hipame piiniteya mɨrayepinetsie xeketenekapini».   
\p
\v 20 Hikɨ mawari wewiwamete 'awate kuxinetayari mekaniutihɨtsieni, yaxeikɨata teɨteri mekaniutihiwa kwi karima, 'ana kwitɨwa wahɨxie Keriku kuraruyari kaniuka'une, kuyaxi 'ixaheritsixi mekaneutahaxɨani naitɨ ti'u'unikaku.  
\v 21 Yunaime mekateniwarukwini 'ixiparakɨ 'ukitsi, 'ukarawetsixi, temari meta 'ukirawetsixi, yaxeikɨata mekaniwarukwini wakaitsixi, muxatsi meta puxuri, yunaime memɨte'ayenenierekai naitɨ kiekari kaniuka'unarieni.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi 'awie nenieremete memuyuhuta mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawekaitɨni: «'Ukaratsi tuminikɨ muyumayɨinɨa hetsɨa xekenehu xekenawitɨki meta 'iwamama yunaime, kexemɨteheyuhɨritɨakai».  
\v 23 Hikɨ temari 'awie nenieremete mekaneutahaxɨani kiitana, mekaniwarayewitɨni Xahawi meta paapamama metatsiere 'iwamama meta naime tiwapiinite, yateewa paitɨ mekaniwarewitɨni 'ahetewakaku 'ixaheritsixi memakuteitsie.  
\v 24 Mɨpaɨ mete'uyurieka mekanitataiya kiekari naime tita mɨrexeiyakai. Pɨratakɨ xeikɨa mɨtiwewiyatɨka hurukɨ wurunitsekɨ meta tepɨakɨ Yawé tukita timieme mekatenayeitɨani.  
\v 25 Mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi Xahawi katiniutawikweitsitɨani meta yunaime 'iwamama tinaime tiwapiinite, mɨwaruti'awietaxɨkɨ 'awie nenieremete mɨkɨ warenɨ'aku Keriku kiekariyaritsie. Mana mɨtiyehane Xahawi meta 'iwamama 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa me'u'uwatɨ mekanakɨne.   
\p
\v 26 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniuyuhɨritɨani:  
\q1 «'Axake'itɨarieka Yawé hɨxie  
\q2 kemɨ'ane 'ikɨ kiekari manukuketɨani.  
\q1 Tenari mɨkatsutɨani  
\q2 yuniwe 'amuyumate tukarieyakɨ.  
\q1 'Itupari meuwɨtɨaxɨani  
\q2 yuniwe 'etsimɨyumate tukarieyakɨ».   
\p
\v 27 Yawé Kutsuhexi hamatɨa kaniuyeikakaitɨni, hikɨ naitsarie kanikɨxaxatsiwakaitɨni mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie.   
\c 7  
\s1 'Akani 'axakemɨtiuyuri  
\p
\v 1 Peru, 'ixaheritsixi Yawé mepɨka'anu'eni memɨte'uti'utaxɨkɨ tita memɨtetitaiyakekai, 'Akani Karimi nu'aya Tsawiri teukarieya Tsera tutsieya, mɨkɨ yatipaɨmeme katiniuti'awieta yuhetsiemieme Kakaɨyari tita mɨti'aitakai memɨtetitaiyakɨ. Mɨkɨ tewi Kura nuiwarieyatsie mieme mɨyatiuyurieku Yawé kaniuyeha'ani 'ixaheritsixi wahekɨ.   
\s1 'Ahi kiekariyari kememɨte'utami  
\p
\v 2 Kutsuhexi Keriku 'ukaitɨ kaniwarenɨ'ani 'awie nenieremete 'Ahi reyetewakaku 'ehurakaku Weti-'Aweni, Weteri hɨxie meta mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Kwie xekenexeiyayu». 'Ana mekaneikuxeiya 'Ahi kiekariyari.  
\v 3 'Ariketa mekanakunuaxɨani mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi mekateniutahɨawe: «Pɨkaheuyewetse teyunaitɨ temɨtakwiyukɨ. Huta miriyari yatɨni haika miriyari kuyaxi mepɨyɨni xeikɨa 'Ahi tema'iwakɨ. Mɨkɨ kiekari 'etsiyupaɨmeme xeikɨa teɨteri pɨwarexeiya yunaime ta'iwama temɨtewa'uxitɨaka pɨkaheuyewetse».  
\v 4 'Ayumieme kuyaxi mekanekɨne haika miriyari xeikɨa, peru matsi 'Ahi kiekatari mepɨtehayu'iwaxɨ.  
\v 5 Kuyaxi 'ixaheritsixi mepekwi'iwaxɨ xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana 'ataxewi, mepanukuweiyarie kiekari kitenie memɨyekɨ mekaniye'axɨani tetexi matixitewatsiepaitɨ mana 'axa'anekɨa mepa'iwarie. Mɨyatiuyɨku yunaitɨ mekaniutimamani.   
\p
\v 6 'Ayumieme, Kutsuhexi yukamixa kaneukatsana kaniutihɨximakeni Yawé tɨratu kakuniyari hɨxie. Mekaneweiyakaitɨni 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima, yaxeikɨa me'anenetɨ meyuheiwerietɨkaitɨ mekaniutihɨxima'uni, taikaike mekananuku'uni.  
\v 7 Kutsuhexi Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\p ―Yawé Kakaɨyari, ¿Titayari 'ikɨ teɨteri petiwaranawitɨ Kurutanitsie, meta petiwayetua 'amuxeutsixi wahetsɨa memɨkwinikɨ? Matsi kuta haa manuyeka 'anutaɨye temɨneyuhayewakaitɨni.  
\v 8 Yakenetineutahɨawi, neti'aitɨwame, ¿kenetayɨni hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi memuyuta'unaxɨ yuneɨkixiwima wahɨxie?  
\v 9 Kananeutsixi mepɨtetamarieni kiekari 'ahurawa mumanetɨkatsie mepɨtehetamarieni, hikɨ tahetsɨa mepɨye'axɨani mepɨtatsikwini. Hikɨtari keraniuwani 'ahepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 10 Yawé mɨpaɨ katinita'eiya:  
\p ―Kenanukukexi. ¿Kepetiyuriene mana petihɨximawetɨ?  
\v 11 'Ixaheritsixi 'axamekateniuyurieni kenemutayɨkai yamepɨkatekakɨ. Memɨwaraye'unie tiwapiini mekatenepini xemɨtetitaiyakekai mekateniuti'awieta yupiinitetsata.  
\v 12 'Ayumieme 'ixaheritsixi mepɨkayɨwaweni memɨwaraye'unie wahɨxie matsi mekaniutinanautsakuni. Yɨkɨmana mekanitiwauni kememɨtekwini. Xɨka mɨkɨ piinite mana mɨtikupine xekate'utitaiya, ne xehamatɨa nepɨka'uyeikani.  
\v 13 Kenanukukexi. Meke'uyu'itieni teɨteri. Mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi 'aixɨa meke'uyuyurieni 'uxa'a nehɨxie memɨti'unikɨ, ne, Yawé, 'ixaheritsixi wakakaɨyari mɨpaɨ nepaine: “'Ixaheritsixi kexemɨteka'unariexime xetsata pɨti'ane. Pepɨkayɨwekaxɨani pemɨwara'iwakɨ pemɨwaraye'unie kepaukake 'aixɨa pemɨtiyurieni 'ateɨterima watsata”.  
\v 14 'Uxa'a ximeri nuiwarite yunaitɨ mepuyukuxeɨrieni. Ne kemɨ'ane nuiwari hetsie 'inɨari nemɨkahɨani yuniwema pɨwakuxeɨrieni, manata Yawé kemɨ'ane wahetsie 'inɨari mɨkahɨani yutɨɨriyama pɨwakuxeurieni, manata Yawé kemɨ'ane wahetsie 'inɨari mɨkahɨani, 'ukitsi puwakuxeɨrieni.  
\v 15 Kemɨ'ane mɨtitaxeiriyarieni piinite memɨyukwitɨwe tiwapiini mɨtititaiyarienikekai kanitataiyariemɨkɨ meta yunaitɨ tɨɨriyamama meta naitɨ tiwapiinite, 'axamɨtiuyurikɨ Yawé kemɨkahainekai 'ixaheritsixi wahetsie 'axati'aneme mɨ'atɨakɨ.   
\s1 'Akani kemɨtiumierie  
\p
\v 16 'Uxa'arieka, ximeripaitɨ, Kutsuhexi kaniwara'iniexɨani, yuxexuime, 'Ixaheri nuiwaritemama, 'ana Kura hetsie katiniunake 'inɨari.  
\v 17 Yunaitɨ Kura niwemama mekaniwakɨne, 'inɨari katiniunake Tsera hetsie. Tsera niwemama hetsieta katiniunake Tsawiri mɨtitewa hetsie.  
\v 18 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨkɨ niwemama kaniwaruti'inɨata, 'inɨari katiniunake 'Akani mɨtitewa hetsie, Karimi nu'aya, Tsawiri teukarieya, Tsera tutsieya.  
\v 19 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katinita'iwawiya:  
\p ―Neuxei neniwe, heitseriemekɨ 'aixɨa keneutayɨki Yawé hɨxie 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari. Kenetineutaxatɨa kepemɨtiuyuri. Tixaɨtɨ pepɨkaneranukanamirieka.   
\p
\v 20 'Akani mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p ―Kaniyuritɨni ne 'axakenemɨtiuyuri Yawé hɨxie 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari. Mɨpaɨ nekatiniuyurieni:  
\v 21 Mɨkɨ mana titixeɨriekaku nekatiniuxeiya tuwaxa 'amɨtewi witsi'aneme Wawiruniya mieme, meta pɨrata tuminiyari huta tsienituyari meta huru meriu kiruyari. Witsimɨti'anenekai nepiinite nepɨrayeitɨa. Hikɨ nepiti'awietaxɨ ne'uti'ineka nexamaru hixɨapa. Pɨrata tsiere muwa patimane, yunaime wahetɨa.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ kwitɨwata Kutsuhexi kaniwarenɨ'ani hipame, mɨkɨ mekanekɨne 'Akani kie me'unautsaxɨaximetɨ. Muwa mekateniutaxeiya tinaime 'Akani mɨtiuti'awietakai,  
\v 23 mekateniwatipini Kutsuhexi hetsɨa mekatenepini meta 'ixaheritsixi, mɨkɨ Yawé hɨxie mekatenitipini.  
\v 24 Kutsuhexi meta 'ixaheritsixi 'Akani mekanewitɨni, Tsera tutsieya, 'Akuhuxi reyetewakaku mekaneiwitɨni, pɨrata 'ixuriki tuwaxayari 'amɨtewi huru meta niwemama 'ukitsi 'ukari, tewamama, 'ixuriki kiyari naime tipiinieya. Kepauka mayeweritsie 'Akuhuxi memu'axɨa,  
\v 25 Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe:  
\p ―¿Titayari 'axapetatiuyuri? Yawé 'ekɨ pɨta 'axapɨmatsiyurieni.  
\p Hikɨ yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'Akani meta niwemama mekaniwarutituaxa tetexikɨ meta mekaniwarutitaiya.  
\v 26 Hikɨ wahetsie tetexi 'anekame mekananukeni hikɨ 'akuxi kaneyuhekɨaka. 'Ayumieme mana pɨrayetewa 'Akuhuxi, 'uximatɨarika 'akiyari manuyɨne. Mɨpaɨ Yawé katiniuyunɨtɨani.   
\c 8  
\s1 Yametekakɨneka kememɨte'ayu'iwaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katinayehɨtɨani: «Pepɨkamaka kene'awaɨriyani. Yunaime keniwaranuwitɨki kuyaxi, 'Ahi xekeneutami'a. Ne nepɨxeparewieni ti'aitame xema'iwakɨ meta kuyaximama. Wakiekari xepiinite katinayeimɨkɨ meta naitɨ kwieyari memanu'uwa.  
\v 2 Keriku kepemuyuri yaxeikɨata pekatiniyurimɨkɨ mɨkɨ kiekaritsie meta mana ti'aitametsie. Hikɨrixɨa kuyaxi memɨxe'aye'unie tiwapiinite xekatenanupikuni meta watewama. Xekeniwaruhupi kiekari mananieretsie».   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ mekanekɨne Kutsuhexi yukuyaxima warawitɨtɨ kiekari 'Ahi mehetamienike. Kutsuhexi kaniwaranuyewauni xeitewiyari heimana tamamata miriyari (30.000) kaniwarenɨ'ani tɨkarikɨ  
\v 4 mɨpaɨ tiwahɨritɨatɨ: «Xeme xepeyuti'awieta kiekari waritatsie. 'Eteewa paitɨ xepɨkahekɨkani, xepɨkahekuyuatɨkani xematitenitsie.  
\v 5 Ne nekanaye'amɨkɨ nekuyaxima newarawitɨtɨ, kepauka memɨtatsi'aye'unie memɨwayekɨne metatsitakwinike, tekaniyuta'unakuni matɨari hepaɨ.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨta mepɨtatsi'anukuweiya, tawarita teyuta'uname me'erietɨ, mɨpaɨ teyɨyɨ mepayekɨne yukiekaritsie.  
\v 7 Hikɨ xeme xekaniwatikɨnikuni xemuyu'awietatɨka 'Ahi kiekariyari xekanika'unakuni. Yawé kanixeparewimɨkɨ xemɨte'ayu'iwakɨ.  
\v 8 Kepauka kiekaritsie xemɨye'axɨani, xekenetataiya Yawé yaxeikɨa kemɨtarahɨawekai. Mɨpaɨ nekatinixe'aitɨaka».   
\p
\v 9 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka Kutsuhexi, kaniwarenɨ'ani kuyaxi memehupanikɨ, Weteri meta 'Ahi wahixɨapa mekaneyuhayewa, kiekari kemɨremakai tau manukayuyuipike hepatsie, Kutsuhexi tɨkarikɨ mana mekanitiheteitɨni yukuyaxima warawitɨtɨ.   
\p
\v 10 Kwi 'uximerikaku Kutsuhexi kananukukeni, yukuyaxima kaniwarukuha'aritɨani, 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima yunaitɨ mekanekɨne 'Ahi mɨreyetewatsie.  
\v 11 'Ahi heuhurakaku Kutsuhexi kuyaximama mana mekaniuyuhayewa, kiekari yeta. Kiekari makumakaitsie meta mematitekaitsie wahixɨapa xeikɨa kanayewerikaitɨni.  
\v 12 Kutsuhexi kaniwarenɨ'ani 'auxɨwime miriyari (5.000) para memɨwatihupienikɨ, mɨkɨ mekaniuyuti'awieta Weteri 'Ahi wahixɨapa kiekari tserieta tau manukayuyuipike hepatsie.  
\v 13 Mɨpaɨ mekaniuyɨni hipatɨ kiekari yeta mekaniuyuhayewa, hipatɨta wa'utata. 'Ana tɨkariyaritsie Kutsuhexi kaniyeyani mayeweri hixɨapa.   
\p
\v 14 Kepauka ti'aitame 'Ahi kiekame mɨretima kemɨtiyɨanekai, kaniuyukumexɨitɨani wayeyanike yukuyaxima warawitɨtɨ memɨwatakwinikɨ 'ixaheritsixi, kiekari hɨxie 'etsimanuyewatsie mayeweritsie, 'atsimekatemaitɨ kememɨtehupieriekai kiekari 'aurie.  
\v 15 Kutsuhexi yukuyaxima 'ixaheritsixi warawitɨtɨ mekaniutinautsa me'imaitɨwetɨ huyeta makumawetsie haneme'utɨa.  
\v 16 Mɨpaɨ mekateniuyumani kiekaritsie memɨtitekai 'ukitsi kename mewaranukuweiyakekai 'ixaheritsixi, mɨpaɨ 'Ahi kiekariyari mekateniuku'eirieni.  
\v 17 Nixewitɨ pɨka'uyuhayewaxɨ kiekari 'Ahi meta Weteri mɨrakutewakaitsie yunaitɨ mepɨwaranukuwei 'ixaheritsixi, 'ayumieme kiekari yuxaɨta kaniuyuhayewa.   
\p
\v 18 Mɨpaɨ Yawé Kutsuhexi katiniuta'aitɨani: «'Ɨrɨ 'amɨtewi pemakwe'e 'Ahi hepa keneukatsera, kiekari 'ahetsɨa nekaniyetuamɨkɨ». Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni.  
\v 19 Me'uneneniereka kemɨtiyɨanekai memuyu'awietakai mekaniwatikɨne kiekari makumatsie mekaneutahaxɨani mekanitataiya.   
\p
\v 20 Kepauka 'Ahi kiekatari 'ukitsi yɨ'utɨa memanakunenierixɨa, kɨtsi mekaniuxeiya kiekaritsie hatineikame. Mɨpaɨ mekatenetimani kename memɨyuta'unakekai mekayɨwawekai nihawaikɨtɨma, meta meripaitɨ memuyuta'unakai Kutsuhexi teɨterimama, hikɨta pɨta mekaniwakwitɨwekaitɨni memɨwaraye'unie.  
\v 21 Kutsuhexi meta yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekaniuneniere, memuyuti'awietakai kiekari kememɨte'uka'unakairi kememɨte'itataiyakai, 'ana mekaniukunuaxɨani 'Ahi kiekatari mekaniwarutakwini.  
\v 22 Kiekari memutataiyaxɨ mekaniwayekɨne kiekaritsie 'Ahi kiekatari mekaniwaranukuweiya, mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ hixɨapa mekanikunakaitɨni. 'Ixaheritsixi mekaniwarutakwini memɨwaraye'unie xeimetɨma mekahayewatɨ 'ayeniereme.  
\v 23 Ti'aitame 'Ahi kiekame mekaniuwiya mekanihayewa 'ayeniereme Kutsuhexi mekaniyetuirieni.   
\p
\v 24 'Arike 'ixaheritsixi mewarukwika yeuta meta makumawetsie, yunaime memɨwaranukuweiyakai 'Ahi kiekatari, mekanakunuaxɨani kiekaritsie mana keyupaumetɨ memuyuhayewatɨwekai yunaime mekaniwarukwini.  
\v 25 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie 'Ahi kiekatari yunaitɨ mekaniukwini, tamamata heimana huta miriyari (12.000) 'ukitsi meta 'ukari.  
\v 26 Kutsuhexi yumamá pɨka'anukatetɨwakai 'ɨrɨ 'amɨtewi makwekaikɨ, kepaukake 'ixaheritsixi yunaime memɨwarukwi 'Ahi kiekatari.  
\v 27 Yawé kemɨtiu'aitakai, 'ixaheritsixi mekatenepini memɨwarukwi tiwapiinite meta tewaxi yunaime yuhetsie meteniɨhɨni.  
\v 28 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi kiekari kaniutataiya 'unitɨ xeikɨa kaniuyuhayewa, hikɨ 'akuxi kaneyuhekɨaka.  
\v 29 Meta 'Ahi kiekariyaritsie ti'aitame kaniuta'aita mɨkawiyanikɨ kɨyetsie, meta mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni mana muyewiekakɨ kepaukake tau makayunekekai. Hikɨ 'akayuneku, Kutsuhexi katiniuta'aita ti'aitame kaxarieya makahanienikɨ kiekari kitenie memeiyehɨanikɨ. Yaxeikɨata katiniuta'aita tetexi mukuxeɨriyanikɨ hetsiena. Mɨkɨ tetexi mukuxeɨriya hikɨ 'akuxi kaneyuhekɨaka.   
\s1 Kemɨrakaterɨwarie 'inɨari niukiyari  
\p
\v 30 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi 'Ewari yemuriyaritsie tetexi kaniukuxeɨrieni mawari wewiwame kaniutawewieni Yawé hetsiemieme 'ixaheritsixi wakakaɨyari,  
\v 31 Muitsexi Yawé nɨ'arieya, kemɨtiwaru'aitɨakai 'ixaheritsixi. Kanitawewieni 'inɨari niukiyari xapayaritsie kemɨre'uxakai Muitsexi meka'utɨa: tetexikɨ wewiyakame mawari wewiwame, tetexi kaxixiyatɨkaime nitixaɨtɨkɨ. Mana mawari taiyariyari mekaniuwewieni meta 'aixɨa memɨteyuxeiyanikɨ mawariyari Yawé hetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 32 Mana 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie Kutsuhexi tetexi wewerime hetsie, 'inɨari niukiyari kaniuti'utɨani hekwamekɨ Muitsexi meka'utɨakai.  
\v 33 Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'ukirawetsixi mewaruwitɨtɨ meta te'aitamete tewa'aitɨwamete 'itsɨkate, mekaniti'uni tɨratu kakuniyari 'aurie naitsata mawari wewiwamete rewitsixi wahɨxie memikweiximekai. Merikɨte 'ixaheritsixi meta mana memɨkakiekataritɨkai 'aixɨa mekateniu'uni, hixɨapa me'atɨ mɨkɨ Keritsini yemuriyarietsie meheutayunetɨ, hipatɨta 'Ewari yemuriyaritsie meheutayunetɨ, kemɨtiu'aitakai Muitsexi Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, kepauka matɨari mitawawiri Kakaɨyari 'aixɨa mɨwayurienikɨ mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi teɨteriyari.   
\p
\v 34 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi kanekaterɨwa naime 'inɨari niukiyari ke'aixɨa mɨtiyuyuruwa meta titakɨ 'axatemɨte'itɨarieni kemɨre'uxa 'inɨari niukiyari xapayaritsie.  
\v 35 Hikɨ kemɨtiuteruwaxɨ Kutsuhexi yunaime 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie, meyuxewitɨ 'ukarawetsixi, tɨɨri, meta 'ateewa kiekatari xeime niukiyari pɨkahatɨmai, Muitsexi kemɨtiu'aitakai.   
\c 9  
\s1 Kawahunitari kememɨte'u'ita  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ te'aitamete mekanixuawekaitɨni Kurutani 'anataɨye tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, muhɨriyatsie, muweritsie meta naitsarie haramara Meritexaniyu hatetsitayaritsie, metatsiere Riwanu paitɨ: hetitsixi, 'amuxeutsixi, kananeutsixi, peretseutsixi, heweutsixi meta kewutseutsixi memakuteitsie. Kepauka tewa'aitɨwamete memu'enana 'ixaheritsixi kememɨteyuriekai,  
\v 2 mekaniuyuparewieni yunaitɨ yamekateniuxata Kutsuhexi memɨtamienikɨ meta 'ixaheritsixi.   
\p
\v 3 Kawahuni kiekatari mete'utamarieka Kutsuhexi Keriku 'Ahi kemɨtiwaruka'unakai,  
\v 4 mekateniutaxata kememɨtewa'irɨwiya. Tupiritsixi mekaniwarenɨ'ani, wapuxurima kuxitariteta yeye'imeta mete'utɨkɨme meta nawi kɨxauriyari winu mukatuarike hatsatsanime hamanetsikitɨkaimeta.  
\v 5 Yu'ixurikite mepɨte'anakatɨtɨkatei meripai timieme, yukakai xutɨkaimetsie mepeu'ukai hatapietɨkaimetsie, paa mepu'ɨkai kɨraraunime temɨxikiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨkai.  
\v 6 Mekanekɨne Kirikari 'aurie Kutsuhexi mematiteitsie mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani, Kutsuhexi hɨxie meta 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie:  
\p ―Tame 'ateewa paitɨ tepanexɨa xeime kwieyaritsie, tɨratu tepukuwewietɨwe xehamatɨa.   
\p
\v 7 'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Matsi xeme xɨari 'ahurawa xepɨkiekatari, 'ayumieme tame tɨratu temuwewieni tepɨkayɨwawe xehamatɨa.   
\p
\v 8 Mɨkɨ, mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi mekateniutahɨawe:  
\p ―Tame tepɨtawaɨriya temɨtexe'uximayatsiriekakɨ.  
\p Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwaruta'iwawiya:  
\p ―¿Kehate xeme xepɨyua hakewa xepeyekɨ?   
\p
\v 9 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Tame 'ateɨterima tepɨyɨa, tame kwie 'ateewa mukumatsie tepeyekɨ, hakewa 'ikɨ Kakaɨyari Yawé memariwatsiepaitɨ. Tepɨtehetamari naime 'Ekipitu kemɨtiuyuri,  
\v 10 meta te'aitamete yuhutame kemɨwaruyuri 'amuxeutsixi Kurutani 'aurie memɨtamakai: 'ikɨ mepɨhɨkɨtɨkai Tsikuni ti'aitame Hetsiwuni kwieyaritsie mieme, 'Uhuki ti'aitame Watsani kwieyaritsie mieme 'Atsitaruti kiekame.  
\v 11 'Ayumieme takie kiekatari meta memɨtatsi'uwitɨxime mɨpaɨ mepaitɨkatei kename tekeheyukuha'aritɨani 'ateewa temuhukɨ mɨpaɨ temɨtexetahɨawekɨ: “Tame tepɨtawaɨriya xeteɨterima temɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ tɨratu temɨwewienikɨ”.  
\v 12 Kepauka temeyekɨ 'upɨta paa peyumemenikai xɨxɨkatɨ, peru hikɨ xekeneuxeiya kanikɨraraunini kanitemɨxikiyaka.  
\v 13 'Ikɨta nawi kɨxaɨriyari kaxie winuyari mukatuarike pehehekwakai hɨpɨnetɨ kaxie winuyari, hikɨ xeketeneuxeiya naitɨ katinitsatsanini ta'ixurikite meta takakai pɨxɨtɨka yeiyakɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Teɨteri 'ixaheritsixi 'etsiwa kawahunitari wa'ikwai mekateniukwani, peru Yawé mepɨka'uta'iwawiyaxɨ.  
\v 15 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi tɨratu kaniuwewieni waparewienike naimekɨ, yaxeikɨata yakaniutayɨni mɨkawareuyehɨanikɨ. 'Ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima yamekaniutiyuani mɨkɨ tɨratu hepaɨtsita.   
\p
\v 16 Haika tukari heutineku tɨratu memuwewitsie kawahunitari wahamatɨa, 'ixaheritsixi mekateniutamarieni kename 'ahurawa kiekatari meyɨakai.  
\v 17 'Ayumieme mekanekɨne haika tukari mekaneuye'axɨani mɨkɨ kiekaritetsie: Kawahuni, Kapira, Weruti meta Kiriati-Yeharini.  
\v 18 Peru 'ixaheritsixi mepɨka warutakwi, wa'ukiyarima wahamatɨa tɨratu memuwewiekaikɨ, mɨpaɨ meputiyua Yawé hɨxie 'ixaheritsixi wakakaɨyari kename mekawakwini. Mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi yunaitɨ mekaniuyeha'ani 'ukirawetsixi wahepaɨtsita.  
\v 19 'Ukirawetsixi mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Tame tɨratu tepuwewi Yawé 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya hetsiemieme, temɨwarukwini tepɨkayɨwawe.  
\v 20 'Ipaɨ pɨta tekaniwayurikuni: tepɨkawakwini 'uximatɨarika te'upitɨarienikɨ, tɨratu te'uwewieka temɨte'itanikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Hikɨ hutarieka mɨpaɨ mekateniuxata.  
\p ―Mekaniu'uwakuni perutsɨ kɨ'ewemete meta hanɨwemete mekanihɨkɨtɨkakuni takiekaritsie.  
\p Mɨpaɨ mete'uxataka mekatenaye'atɨani tɨratu kememɨte'uwewi.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi kawahunitari mɨpaɨ katiniwarutatieni:  
\p ―¿Titayari xetate'u'itaiyaxɨ kename 'ateewa xekiekatari xe'utiyuatɨ, 'ahurawa xekiekataritɨtɨ?  
\v 23 'Ena mɨtiyehane mɨpaɨ 'axaxepɨtepitɨarieni: Te'uximayatamete xepakɨne, Kakaɨyari tukieyata miemete. Kɨ'ewemete xepɨhɨkɨtɨni meta hanɨwemete.   
\p
\v 24 Kawahunitari mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Tame texe'uximayatsiriwamete, tepɨte'utaxatɨarie kename Yawé xekakaɨyari mɨpaɨ tiuta'aitaxɨ Muitsexi ti'a'uximayatsiriwame, mɨxeyetuirienikɨ 'ikɨ kwie naime, xewakwitɨ teɨteri mana kiekatari, teputimama waɨkawa tekaheukwikutɨ 'ayumieme mɨyatepɨte'uyuri.  
\v 25 Tame xehetsiemieme tepɨhɨkɨ, yaxeketeneuyuri takɨmana kehepaɨ mɨtiheitserie kehepaɨ 'aixɨa mɨ'ane.   
\p
\v 26 Mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi katiniwarutawikweitsitɨani kawahunitari, 'ixaheritsixi mewakwikukaku.  
\v 27 'Ana mɨtiyetɨa Kutsuhexi kɨ'ewemete kaniwarayeitɨani meta hanɨwemete 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme kepauka memuyuxeɨriekatsie, matsi yemekɨ mawari taiyame Yawé hetsiemieme mepɨte'uximayakai hakewa mɨkɨ Yawé menayexei. Hikɨ 'akuxi yaxeikɨa mɨpaɨ mepɨtehe'uximaya.   
\c 10  
\s1 Te'aitamete 'amuxeutsixi kememɨte'utakwi'iwaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 'Arunitsereki ti'aitame Kerutsareme kiekame katiniutamarieni kename Kutsuhexi 'Ahi ha'iwakai 'ika'unakai naime, Kutsuhexi Keriku kemuyuriekai meta mana ti'aitame yaxeikɨa pɨtiuyuriekai 'Ahi meta ti'aitameya. Metatsiere Harunitsereti katiniutamariekaitɨni kename Kawahuni kiekatari 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa tɨratu me'uwewiekai wahamatɨa me'u'uwakai.  
\v 2 Hikɨ waɨkawa mepɨmamakai 'Arunitsereki meta teɨterimama mɨpaɨ memɨtemaikaikɨ Kawahuni kiekariyari matsi pɨmariwekai kwinimieme kaniyeukaitɨni wamu'uyari hepaɨ, kuyaxi metehayu'iwame kaniwarexeiyakaitɨni, 'Ahi matsi 'etsipɨyeukai 'akuxi.   
\p
\v 3 'Ayumieme 'Arunitsereki xapa kaneutanɨ'axɨani 'ikɨ te'aitamete wahetsɨa: Huhani Hewuruni kiekame, Pirani Karimuti kiekame, Kapiha Rakixi kiekame meta Rewixi 'Ekuruni kiekame.  
\v 4 Mɨpaɨ hayetaineme: «Xekeneneuparewi Kawahuni kiekariyari tepɨtamieni titayari mɨyatiuyɨ Kutsuhexi tiutinɨi meta 'ixaheritsixi».   
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ meyu'aɨxɨwitɨ te'aitamete 'amuxeutsixi Kerutsareme kiekatari, Hewuruni, Karimuti, Rakixi meta 'Ekuruni mekaniuyunɨni mekanekɨne yukuyaxima mewaruwitɨtɨ Kawahuni hɨxie mekanikuyaxe mewatakwinike.   
\s1 'Amuxeutsixi kememɨteha'iwarie  
\p
\v 6 Hikɨ 'ukitsi Kawahuni kiekatari Kutsuhexi niuki mekanenɨ'airieni Kirikari 'ukaiku mɨpaɨ haineme: «Pepɨkatatsi'uku'e'eiriwani tame 'ateɨterima. Xeiya kenamie taheima keneutanua yunaitɨ te'aitamete 'amuxeutsixi hɨritsie kiekatari mekaniyunɨka metatsi'unietɨ».   
\p
\v 7 Kutsuhexi Kirikari kanayeyani yunaime yukuyaxima warawitɨtɨ, yemekɨ memɨ'ayumiemetetɨkai.  
\v 8 'Ana Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Pepɨkamaka wahɨxie, ne nekameniyetuiriemɨkɨ. Nixewitɨ mɨkɨ mepɨkamatsiha'iwa».   
\p
\v 9 Tɨkarikɨ meheyekɨneka Kirikari paitɨ, Kutsuhexi kaniwarutakwini 'atsimekateha'eriwakaku.  
\v 10 Mɨpaɨ Yawé 'amuxeutsixi katiniwarutimariuta kuyaxi 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie, mɨpaɨ mɨkɨ mekatena'iwarieni mana Kawahuni mɨrakutewatsie. Memuyuta'unaxɨ mekaniwaranukuweiya huye'utɨa Weti-Kuruni haneme, yunaime mɨkɨ mekaniwarukwini mɨkɨ huyeta 'Atseka meta Makera haneme 'utɨa.  
\v 11 Kepauka 'amuxeutsixi memuyuta'unaxɨ 'ixaheritsixi mewakwitɨwekaku, Weti-Kuruni meta 'Atseka wahixɨapa meyukwitɨwetɨ, Yawé muyuawitsie tee 'anenekame kaneyenɨ'ani yuwaɨkawa teɨteri kaniwarukwini, 'ixaheritsixi tsiyupaɨmeme mekaniwarukwini 'ixiparakɨ.   
\p
\v 12 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie kepauka Yawé mɨwarupitɨa 'ixaheritsixi 'amuxeutsixi memɨwara'iwanikɨ, 'ana Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniuyutanenewieni yunaime 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie:  
\q1 «Tau, kenewakexi Kawahuni heima,  
\q2 metseri, kenewakexi 'Ayaruni heima».   
\b  
\q1
\v 13 Tau kaniwakeni 'utukakaku  
\q2 meta metseri yaxeikɨa,  
\q1 kepaukake 'ixaheritsixi  
\q2 memɨtehayu'iwaxɨ.  
\m 'Ikɨ mɨpaɨ pɨre'uxa Katsexi xapayaritsie. Mɨpaɨ katiniuyɨni, tau kaniwakeni 'utukakaku pɨka'ukuyua xeitukari kaniuyurieni.  
\v 14 Nihawaikɨ meripaitɨ nitawari mɨpaɨ pɨkatiyɨwe, 'ana tukaritsie Yawé tewi 'aitsikaya panu'eni. Mɨpaɨ pɨtimatsiɨkɨ 'ana Yawé puyumienekai 'ixaheritsixi waparewietɨ.   
\p
\v 15 Yunaime mewarukwikari, Kutsuhexi kanakunuani Kirikari mɨrakutewatsie yunaime yukuyaxima warawitɨtɨ.   
\s1 Te'aitamete 'amuxeutsixi kememɨte'ukwi  
\p
\v 16 Meyu'auxɨwitɨ te'aitamete mekaniuyuta'unakaitɨni terɨta paitɨ Makera kiekariyari 'aurie.  
\v 17 Kepauka Kutsuhexi mɨretima kename mehetaxeiyariekairi memɨyu'auxɨwi te'aitamete terɨta,  
\v 18 'ana mɨpaɨ katiniu'aita: «Terɨ kitenie xekeneutetsa manata hipame xetewaretixɨrieni memɨtehetahɨkakɨ.  
\v 19 Xewitɨ pɨkaheyukuhayeikawani. Kuyaxi teparewiwamete mekewaranukuweiya memɨyuta'unaxɨa. Mepɨkawarepitɨaka yukiekaritetsie memeye'axeni. Yawé xekakaɨyari kanixeyetuirieniri».   
\p
\v 20 Kutsuhexi meta kuyaxi 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwarukwini memɨwaraye'uniekai, 'etsiyupaɨmetɨ xeikɨa mekaniyuta'una kiekaritetsie kuraru 'amatitetewa maheitɨkatsie.  
\v 21 'Imatɨrieka, yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekaniuyukuxeɨrieni Makera kiekariyaritsie 'aixɨa meteheu'erietɨ nixewitɨ pɨkatiukwinitɨarie. Mana naitsarie yunaitɨ memɨtamakai nixewitɨ 'atsipɨkatiwarahɨawekai 'ixaheritsixi.   
\p
\v 22 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi katiniutanɨ'ani terɨta mɨreuyepiyanikɨ meta memɨwayehapanienikɨ te'aitamete 'amuxeutsixi memuyu'auxɨwi.  
\v 23 Yapauka te'aitamete memɨyu'auxɨwi mekaniwayehapanieni terɨta: Kerutsareme, Hewuruni, Karimuti, Rakixi meta 'Ekuruni.  
\v 24 Kepauka memɨ'atɨarie, Kutsuhexi kaniwaruta'inieni yunaime kuyaxi 'ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe kuyaxi wa'ukiyarima memikuweiyatɨwekai: «'Ahurawa xekenakɨni te'aitamete wakɨipitsie xekena'uti». Kuyaxi tewa'aitɨwamete yamekatenikakɨne kwitɨ.  
\v 25 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Xepɨkamamaka yu'utɨa xepɨka'uyekɨkani, matsi pɨta xekenetɨrɨkawini xepɨkamamaka. Mɨpaɨ kaniwayuriemɨkɨ Yawé kemɨ'ane xemɨwatakwini».   
\p
\v 26 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka Kutsuhexi, kaniwarukwini te'aitamete, 'auxɨwime kɨyexitsie kaniwaruyewɨtɨani, mana kaniwaruku'eirieni tukarikɨ.  
\v 27 Tau 'akayunirɨmekakuke Kutsuhexi katiniuta'aita wakaxari makahapanienikɨ, terɨta memayu'awietakaitsie memeutaxɨriyanikɨ. Hikɨ mekateneunani terɨta tetexi 'anenekame mekaneuyatsa, hikɨ 'akuxi kanehekɨaka.   
\p
\v 28 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Kutsuhexi Makera kiekariyaritsie kaniye'ani, yu'ixiparakɨ mana ti'aitame kaniumieni meta mana kiekatari yunaime mekaniwarukwini. Ti'aitame Makera kiekame Keriku mɨti'aitametɨkai hepaɨ katiniumierieni.   
\s1 Kiekari tatsutɨa hepatsie kemɨra'iwarie  
\p
\v 29 Kutsuhexi meta yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi Makera mɨrakutewatsie memɨyekɨ, mekanekɨne Riwina kiekariyaritsie meta mɨkɨ mekaniwarutakwini.  
\v 30 Yawé kaniwaruparewieni 'ixaheritsixi 'ana yunaime mekaniwara'iwa meta ti'aitame teɨterimama. Kutsuhexi katiniuta'aita 'ixiparakɨ memɨkwi'iwakɨ. Nixewitɨ pɨka'uyuhayewaxɨ 'ayenieretɨ. Keriku mɨti'aitametɨkai kemɨtiumierie yaxeikɨa Riwinatsie ti'aitame hepaɨna katiniumierieni.   
\p
\v 31 Kutsuhexi meta yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi, Riwina memɨyekɨ mekanekɨne Rakixi. Mana me'u'axɨaka kiekari warita mekanayaxetɨkɨne hikɨ mekaniwarutakwini.  
\v 32 Yawé kaniwaruparewieni 'ixaheritsixi, hutarieka tukaritsie mekaniwara'iwa. Yunaitɨ Rakixi kiekatari mekaniukwini, Riwina kiekatari kememɨte'anuyekɨ wahepaɨ.  
\v 33 Hikɨta, Hurani ti'aitame Ketsehexi kiekame, kanayeyani Rakixi hetsie tanuanike, 'ana mɨkɨ yunaitɨ kuyaximama mekaniukwi'iwa. Nixewitɨ pɨka'utawikwei Kutsuhexi kuyaximama wa'ixiparate hetsie.   
\p
\v 34 Kutsuhexi meta yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi Rakixi memɨyekɨ 'Ekuruni mekaniye'axɨani. Kiekari warita mekanayaxetɨkɨne mekaniwarutakwini.  
\v 35 Xeitukaritsie yunaime mekaniwarukwini 'ixiparakɨ mekaniwara'iwa, yaxeikɨa Rakixi kiekatari kememɨtewarukwikai.   
\p
\v 36 Kutsuhexi meta yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekuruni memɨyekɨ mekanekɨne Hewuruni, meta mana kiekatari mekaniwarutakwini.  
\v 37 'Ixaheritsixi kuyaxiyari mɨkɨ kiekaritsie yunaime mekaniwarukwini 'ixiparakɨ, nixewitɨ pɨka'utawikwei, meta mana ti'aitame kaniumierieni yaxeikɨata kiekari mamanetɨkatsie kiekatari. 'Ekuruni kemɨtiuyɨ, Hepurunita mɨpaɨ katiniuka'unarieni.   
\p
\v 38 Kutsuhexi meta 'ixaheritsixi Hepuruni memɨyekɨ mekanekɨne Rewixi mekaniutamieni.  
\v 39 Kiekari mekaniutanenixeiya meta mana mɨti'aitametɨkai meta 'auriena mamanetɨkatei kiekari, yunaime mana kiekatari mekaniwarukwini mawari hepaɨ. Nixewitɨ pɨka'uyuhayewaxɨ 'ayenieretɨ. Rewixi yaxeikɨa katinanuyeyani kemɨranuyeyakai Riwina meta Hewuruni meta mana te'aitamete.   
\p
\v 40 Mɨpaɨ Kutsuhexi katiniuyurieni mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie: hɨritsie, Nekexi mɨreyetewatsie, muweritsie, mukɨatsie. Yunaime te'aitamete kaniwarukwini xeime kahayewatɨ. Yunaitɨ memɨte'ayeneniere mekateniukwi'iwa. 'Ikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni Yawé mɨti'aitɨakaikɨ, 'ixaheritsixi wakakaɨyari.  
\v 41 Kutsuhexi yunaime kiekarite kaniwara'iwa Karetsi-Waxineya paitɨ meta Kahatsa, meta Kutseheni, Kawahuni paitɨ.  
\v 42 Mɨkɨ yunaime te'aitamete meta wakwieyaritetsie Kutsuhexi katinayu'iwa, matsi Yawé 'ixaheritsixi wakakaɨyari mɨwaparewiekaikɨ.   
\p
\v 43 Mɨyatiuyuriekake kanakunuani Kutsuhexi Kirikari 'aurie memakutekaitsie, yunaime yukuyaxima 'ixaheritsixi warawitɨtɨ.   
\c 11  
\s1 Te'aitamete tayeta hepatsie kememɨteha'iwarie  
\p
\v 1 Kepauka Kawini, Katsuxi kwieyaritsie ti'aitame mɨtiutamari naitɨ kemɨreyɨkai, Kuwawi kaniuta'inieni, Maruni kwieyaritsie ti'aitame, meta te'aitamete Tsimiruni kiekatari meta 'Akitsahapi kiekatari.  
\v 2 Meta kaniwaruta'inieni te'aitamete hɨritsie tayeta kiekatari, meta harakuna mayematsie Kinereti tsutɨayaritsie, tau manatineika hepaɨtsita mayeweritsie, meta Naputi-Ruxi kiekatari, tau makayuyuipike hepatsie.  
\v 3 Yaxeikɨata kaniwaruta'inieni kananeutsixi tau manatineika makayuyuipike hepatsie kiekatari, 'amuxeutsixi, hetitsixi, peretseutsixi, kewutseutsixi hɨritsie kiekatari meta heweutsixi kɨatsata memɨkatei Heximuni Mitsipa hɨriyaritsie.   
\p
\v 4 Mɨkɨ meyunaitɨ mekanayeixɨani yukuyaxima mewaruwitɨtɨ meta kawayutsixi kaxetatsixi memɨyutakwinikɨ. Mekaniyumɨirekaitɨni xiekari hepaɨ mekateniyuxexeiyakaitɨni.  
\v 5 Yunaitɨ mekaniuyutaxewire, Merumi haixayari matineniere 'aurie mekanitiyaxe 'ixaheritsixi mewatakwinike.   
\p
\v 6 Merikɨte Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «Pepɨkawamakaka, matsi 'uxa'a ximeri 'epauka, 'ixaheritsixi nekaniwayetuiriemɨkɨ mekwikwi'ime yunaime kuyaxi. Xemeta wakawayutsixi xepɨwatiwiteni wa'ɨkate tatayaritsie, wakaxetate xepɨtitaiya kɨmana memɨyukwitɨwekai».   
\p
\v 7 Mɨpaɨ katineyani Kutsuhexi warawitɨtɨ yukuyaxima mekaniwarutaxeiya 'atsimekateha'eriwame Merumi haixayari makaneniere 'aurie.  
\v 8 Yawé kaniwayetuani 'ixaheritsixi memɨwara'iwakɨ, mɨkɨ mekaniwaranukuweiya kiekari 'amɨyewatsie paitɨ Tsiruni, meta Mitsireputi-Mahini meta mayeweritsie Mitsipa tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, nixewitɨ pɨka'uyuhayewaxɨ 'ayenenieretɨ.  
\v 9 Kutsuhexi katinaye'atɨani Yawé kemɨrehɨawekai: Memɨwaraye'unie wakawayutsixi wa'ɨkate tatayaritsie kaniwarutiwiteni meta wakaxetate kaniutitaiya kɨmana memɨyukwitɨwekai.   
\p
\v 10 Me'akunuaxɨaka Kutsuhexi Katsuxi kaniutamieni meta tiwa'aitɨwame yu'ixiparakɨ kaniumieni, Katsuxi manuyeka pɨhɨkɨtɨkai yɨmɨireme te'aitamete tiwa'aitɨwame.  
\v 11 'Ixaheritsixi yunaime mepɨtewarukwi memɨte'ayeneniere, kiekari mekaniuka'una mekanitataiya mawari hepaɨ.  
\v 12 Kutsuhexi yumɨireme te'aitamete wahetsɨa kaniye'ani wakwinetɨ kiekaritetsie, 'ikɨ kaniwarukwini yu'ixiparakɨ wakwitɨ mawari hepaɨ. Mɨpaɨ tiyurienetɨ mɨkɨ yakatinikayani Kutsuhexi Muitsexi, Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, kemɨtita'aitɨakai.  
\v 13 Kiekari yemuritsie mɨkamane 'ixaheritsixi mepɨka'ititaiyaxɨ, Katsuxi xeikɨa mekaniutataiya.  
\v 14 'Ixaheritsixi yuhetsiemieme mekatenayeitɨani tinaime wapiinite meta watewama, yunaime mekaniwarukwini 'ukitsi nixewitɨ pɨka'uyuhayewaxɨ.  
\v 15 Mɨpaɨ Yawé Muitsexi tiyu'uximayatsiriwame kemɨtiuta'aitɨakai hepaɨ. Yaxeikɨata Muitsexi Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniuta'aitɨani. Mɨkɨ yakatinikayani kemɨraka'utɨariekai, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨakai.   
\s1 Kememɨte'ukɨ metehayu'iwatɨ  
\p
\v 16 Kutsuhexi naime mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie memɨtamakai kaniwara'iwa: naitsarie muhɨriyatsie, Nekexi, Kutseheni kwieyaritsie, naitɨ mayeweritsie, 'Arawa, 'Ixaheri kwieyari muhɨriyatsie meta mayeweritsie.  
\v 17 Metatsiere kwie 'ayeyeume memeuxeiya wahetsɨa kaniye'ani, Karaki hɨriyaritsie Tsehixi kwieyari maye'atɨka, meta Wahari-Kahari mayeweritsie Riwanu paitɨ, hɨri Heximuni warita. Kutsuhexi te'aitamete kaniwarutiwiya yunaime mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie kiekatari kaniwarukwini,  
\v 18 mɨixa wiyari mewakwitɨwetɨ.   
\p
\v 19 Nixewitɨ kiekari tɨratu pɨka'uta'iwau 'ixaheritsixi wahamatɨa memɨwaparewienikɨ, heweutsixi xeikɨa Kawahuni kiekatari. Naime mɨkɨ kiekarite Kutsuhexi puka'unaxɨ,  
\v 20 matsi Yawé wa'iyari kaniutseiriyaxɨani memɨwaraye'unie kaniwaruyuitɨani memɨwatakwinikɨ 'ixaheritsixi, mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni Kananitari memɨka'unarienikɨ mawari hepaɨ, 'ixaheritsixi mekawanenimayatɨ, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨakai.   
\p
\v 21 'Ana Kutsuhexi kaniwaruka'una 'anakitsixi hɨritsie Hewuruni kiekatari, Rewixi, 'Anawi, meta muhɨriyatsie Kura kwieyaritsie yunaime 'Ixaheri. Teɨteri meta kiekarite Kutsuhexi kaniwaruka'una.  
\v 22 Nixewitɨ pɨka'uyuhayewaxɨ 'ayenieretɨ 'anaki tewiyari, 'ixaheritsixi mema'axɨatsie. Kiekarite Kahatsa, Kahati meta 'Atsiruri mana xeikɨa yayupaɨmetɨ mepuyuhayewaxɨ.   
\p
\v 23 Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwara'iwa mɨkɨ kwieyarite naime, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨa, Kutsuhexi kaniwayetuirieni mɨyetuiriyarie yuxexuime nuiwarite 'ixaheritsixi mekateniyetuiriyarieni. 'Anari mekaniuka'uxipieni meyukwitɨwetɨ hɨritsie.   
\c 12  
\s1 'Ixaheritsixi Kurutani meka'axɨawawetɨ  
\p
\v 1 Meripaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi yuhutame te'aitamete mepɨwara'iwaxɨ wakwie Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie mukuma, 'aki manuyekatsie 'Axinuni ye'atɨkaitɨ Heximuni hɨriyaritsie pɨye'atɨkatei, yaxeikɨa 'Arawa tau manatineika hepatsie mukuma.   
\p
\v 2 Xewitɨ pɨtitewakai Tsikuni 'amuxeutsixi tiwa'aitɨwame, 'uwenieya Hetsiwuni kiekariyaritsie kaniuwekaitɨni. 'Ikɨ pɨti'aitakai 'Aruhexi ye'atɨkaime, mɨkɨ kiekari 'Axinuni 'aki tetsita pɨyemakai, meta 'aki Kawuki manuyekatsie pɨye'atɨkatei 'amunitsixi wakwie manuye'atɨka. Tsikuni kwieya pɨhɨkɨtɨkai mayeweri meta hixɨapa 'atɨ Karaha kwieyari.  
\v 3 'Arawa tau manatineika hepatsie pɨye'atɨkatei meta Kinereti harakuna mayematsie paitɨ, manata Haramara Mɨmɨki mayematsie paitɨ, Weti-Yetsimuti kiekariyari huyeyari 'utɨa, matsi 'akuxi hetɨana paitɨ, Pitsikaha yemuriyaritsie mukɨatsie paitɨ.   
\p
\v 4 Xewitɨta ti'aitame 'Uhuki pɨtitewakai, Watsani kiekariyaritsie ti'aitame, xepahitsixi tewiyari 'imatɨrieka mieme pɨhɨkɨtɨkai 'Atsitaruti meta 'Erurehi mukatei.  
\v 5 'Ikɨ ti'aitame pɨti'aitakai Heximuni hɨriyaritsie meta Tsarikaha mɨrayetewatsie, meta naitsarie Watsani kwieyaritsie, Ketsuxi meta Mahaka wakwie manuye'atɨkatsiepai pɨye'atɨkatei, meta Karaha hixɨapa 'arɨkame, meta Tsikuni kwieya manuye'atɨkatsiepaitɨ ti'aitame Hetsiwuni kiekame.   
\p
\v 6 'Ixaheritsixi Muitsexi tiwa'aitɨakaku Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, mɨkɨ te'aitamete mekaniwara'iwa. 'Ana Muitsexi Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, mɨkɨ kwie kaniwaruti'inɨatsirieni Xuweni, Kahari waxiɨyarima meta Manatsexi xiɨyarimama hixɨata me'arɨkame.   
\s1 Te'aitamete Kutsuhexi mɨwara'iwaxɨ  
\p
\v 7 'Ena mepɨhekɨa te'aitamete 'ixaheritsixi memɨwara'iwaxɨ Kutsuhexi tiwa'aitɨakaku waxapayari. Wakwie kanikumanekaitɨni Kurutani tau manukayeika hepatsie, 'akaniyeukaitɨni Wahari-Kahari paitɨ kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, Riwanu mayeweritsie, meta Karaki hɨriyaritsie paitɨ, Tsehixi kwieyari maye'atɨka. Kutsuhexi kaniyetuani 'ikɨ te'aitamete wakwie 'Ixaheri nuiwarimama mɨtiwapiinitɨnikɨ.  
\v 8 Mɨkɨ kwie hipatɨ muhɨriyatsie katini'anekaitɨni, mayeweweritsie tau manukayeika hepatsie muyeka, 'Arawa, mukɨatsarietsie, makumawetsie meta Nekexi kwieyaritsie. Mɨkɨ kwie hetitsixi wakwie kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni meta 'amuxeutsixi, kananeutsixi, peretseutsixi, heweutsixi metatsiere kewutseutsixi. 'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni te'aitamete waxapayari:   
\b  
\li1
\v 9 ti'aitame Keriku mieme,  
\li1 ti'aitame 'Ahi kiekame, kiekari Weteri mehurawa,   
\li1
\v 10 ti'aitame Kerutsareme kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Hewuruni kiekame,   
\li1
\v 11 ti'aitame Karimuti kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Rakixi kiekame,   
\li1
\v 12 ti'aitame 'Ekuruni kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Ketsehexi kiekame,   
\li1
\v 13 ti'aitame Rewixi kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Kerexi kiekame,   
\li1
\v 14 ti'aitame Kuxima kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame 'Arari kiekame,   
\li1
\v 15 ti'aitame Riwina kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame 'Arurani kiekame,   
\li1
\v 16 ti'aitame Makera kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Weteri kiekame,   
\li1
\v 17 ti'aitame Tapuhaki kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Hepexi kiekame,   
\li1
\v 18 ti'aitame 'Apeki kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Tsaruni kiekame,   
\li1
\v 19 ti'aitame Marumi kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Katsuxi kiekame,   
\li1
\v 20 ti'aitame Tsimiruni-Merumi kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame 'Akitsahapi kiekame,   
\li1
\v 21 ti'aitame Tanaki kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Mekiru kiekame,   
\li1
\v 22 ti'aitame Tseretsi kiekame,  
\li1 ti'aitame Kunehani kiekame, Kaximeru hɨriyaritsie mɨti'ane,   
\li1
\v 23 ti'aitame Ruxi kiekame, Naputi-Ruxi mɨreyetewatsie mɨti'ane,  
\li1 ti'aitame Kuhimi kiekame, Kirikari 'aurie mɨti'ane   
\li1
\v 24 meta ti'aitame Tiritsa kiekame.  
\li1 Yunaitɨ te'aitamete xeitewiyari heimana tamamata heimana xewi mekaniyupaɨmekaitɨni.   
\c 13  
\s1 Kutsuhexi hipame teɨteri mɨkawarukwi  
\p
\v 1 Kepaukari Kutsuhexi waɨkawa mu'ukiratsitɨkai Yawé mɨpaɨ katinitahɨawe: «Waɨkawa pekani'ukiratsitɨniri, teɨteri 'akuxi waɨkawa mekaniyuhayewatɨweni pemɨwara'iwakɨ.  
\v 2 Piritsiteutsixi, ketsureutsixi wakwie nekanixatani,  
\v 3 Tsikuxi 'akiyaritsie mɨye'atɨka 'Ekipitu kwieyari maka'atɨka, 'Ekuruni kwieyari maka'atɨkatsie paitɨ kaniye'atɨkani. Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ katinimatiwani kananeutsixi wakwie, mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie yu'auxɨwitɨ te'aitamete mekanititeni piritsiteutsixi: Kahatsa kiekame, 'Atsiruri kiekame, 'Atsikaruni kiekame, Kahati kiekame meta 'Ekuruni kiekame. Yaxeikɨata 'aweutsixi wakwietsie xemɨye'axɨani kaneuyeweka.  
\v 4 Mɨkɨ wahetɨa Kananeutsixi wakwie kaniyuhayewaneni, 'Araki tsiruniyutsixi wakwieyaritsie ye'atɨkaitɨ, 'Apeki paitɨ, Tsiruni ye'atɨkaitɨ, 'amuxeutsixi wakwie manuye'atɨkatsie.  
\v 5 Yaxeikɨatsiere kaniyuhayewaneni Kewari kiekatari wakwie, Riwanu kwieyari yemuri wariepaitɨ metatsiere Wahari-Kahari, hɨritɨa Heximuni mɨtitewa, metatsiere Rewu-Kamati mɨrakutewatsie paitɨ.  
\v 6 Netɨtɨ nepuwataweiya 'ixaheritsixi wahɨxie yunaime Tsiruni kiekatari meta keyupaɨmetɨ hɨritsie memu'uwa, Riwanu paitɨ meta Mitsireputi-Mahini paitɨ.  
\p »'Ekɨri Kutsuhexi, yayeyeume pekaniwayetuiriemɨkɨ 'ikɨ kwie 'ixaheritsixi mɨtiwapiinitɨnikɨ kenematiuta'aitɨa wahetsiemieme.  
\v 7 Kanaye'aniri pemɨwayetuirienitsie kwie 'atanauka nuiwari wahetsiemieme memuyuhayewatɨwe meta hixɨapa me'atɨ Manatsexi xiɨyarimama».   
\s1 Kwie kememɨte'uti'inɨatsiyarie Kurutani 'anutaɨye  
\p
\v 8 Hipatɨ Manatsexi nuiwarimama hixɨata me'atɨ, Xuweni meta Kahari wanuiwarima, kwie mekaniyetuiriyariekaitɨniri Muitsexi Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, kaniwaruxatɨakaitɨniri meripaitɨ.  
\v 9 'Aruhexi paitɨ kaniye'atɨkani wakwie, 'Axinuni 'akiyaritsie 'Aruhexi kiekari pɨyemakai meta kiekari mayeweritsie hixɨapa pɨyemakai. Metatsiere kaniwakwietɨkaitɨni hɨri manaweri Merewa mɨtitewa metatsiere Riwuni,  
\v 10 naitɨ Tsikuni kiekariteya ―'amuxeutsixi mɨtiwa'aitɨwametɨkai mɨti'aitakai Hetsiwuni paitɨ 'ukaitɨ―, 'amunitsixi wakwie manuye'atɨkapaitɨ.  
\v 11 Karaha kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, teɨteri Ketsuxi kiekatari meta Mahaka kiekariyaritsie, naitɨ Heximuni hɨriyari meta Watsani meta Tsarikaha kwieyaritsie paitɨ.  
\v 12 Mɨkɨ kwie 'Uhuki katinipiinieyatɨkaitɨni, ti'aitame Watsani kwieyaritsie, 'Atsitaruti meta 'Erurehi kiekariyaritsie pɨtiuta'aitaxɨ, 'imatɨriekari mieme xepahitsixi tewiyari pɨhɨkɨtɨkai, Muitsexi muwaruka'unaxɨ meta mɨwarayewei mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie.  
\v 13 Peru 'ixaheritsixi Ketsuxi meta Mahaka kiekatari mepɨkawarayewei, hikɨ 'akuxi wakwietsie mekaniu'uwani.   
\p
\v 14 Peru Muitsexi Rewi xiɨyarimama kwie pɨkawayetuiri, Yawé teɨterimama 'imikieri memɨyetuayakaikɨ mawari wewiwamete mɨtiwa hetsiemiemetɨkai, 'ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya, mɨkɨ kemɨtiwarutahɨawekai.   
\p
\v 15 'Ikɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni Muitsexi yuxexuime Xuweni nuiwarimama mɨwayetuiri:  
\v 16 'Aruhexi tsutɨtɨ kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, 'Axinuni 'akiyari manuyeka 'anutaɨye mukumakai, kiekari mexeiyakai mayeweritsie. 'Ikɨta hɨri manaweri Merewa kanihɨkɨtɨni  
\v 17 Hetsiwuni paitɨ meta naitɨ kiekarite manaweritsie mieme: Riwuni, Wamuti-Wahari, Weti-Wahari-Mekuni,  
\v 18 Yahatsa, Karemuti, Mepati,  
\v 19 Kiriyatahini, Tsiwima, Tsareti-Tsakaxi yemuri mayeweri mukatsie mukuma,  
\v 20 Weti-Pehuxi, Weti-Yetsimuti meta kɨatsata Pitsikaha yemuriyaritsie,  
\v 21 tatsɨari kiekarite meta 'etsimɨyeyeu manaweritsie mieme, meta naitɨ hakewa Tsikuni mɨre'aitakai ti'aitame 'amuxeu tewiyari Hetsiwuni mɨti'aitakai. Muitsexi 'ikɨ ti'aitame kana'iwa meta memanuyetei mariyanitsixi, 'Ewi, Xekeni, Tsuxi, Kuxi meta Xewa, yunaitɨ mɨkɨ Tsikuni memɨnɨkai mana memɨkiekataritɨkai.  
\v 22 'Ikɨ 'ixaheritsixi yuwaɨkawa mekaniwarukwini yu'ixiparakɨ kepauka memuyukwitɨwekai, metatsiere tiyukewaiyame Warami Wehuxi nu'aya mekaniumieni.  
\v 23 Kurutani hatɨayari Xuweni xiɨyarimama wa'inɨari kanayani wakwie manuye'atɨka. Mɨkɨ kiekari meta 'etsimɨyeyeu Xuweni xiɨyarimama wahetsiemieme kanayani kememɨyupaɨmekai.   
\p
\v 24 Muitsexi kaniwayetuirienita 'ikɨ kwie Kahari xiɨyarimama kememuyupaɨmekai:  
\v 25 Katsexi kwieyari, naitɨ kiekari Karaha kwieyaritsie mukumane meta 'amunitsixi teɨteriyari wakwie hixɨapa'atɨ, meta 'Aruhexi paitɨ Xawaha kiekariyari hɨxie mukuma,  
\v 26 meta kwie yu'aurie mukumane Hetsiwuni, Xamati-Mitsipe meta Wetunini, Makanahini kwieyari meta Rewixi kwieyari manuye'atɨka.  
\v 27 Mayeweri mekaniyetuiriyarieni Weti-'Arami, Weti-Nimɨra, Tsukuti meta Tsapuni, Tsikuni mɨtiwa'aitɨakai mame, Hetsiwuni kiekariyaritsie mɨti'aitakai. Mɨpaɨ wakwie kaniyeukaitɨni Kurutani 'anutaɨye meta harakuna Kinereti hetɨa paitɨ.  
\v 28 'Ikɨ kiekarite mekaniyetuiriyarieni Kahari xiɨyarimama wapiini katinayani, kememɨyupaɨmekai.   
\p
\v 29 'Ikɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni Muitsexi Manatsexi xiɨyarimama hixɨata me'akame mɨwayetuiri kememɨyupaɨmekai:  
\v 30 wakwie Makanahini meta naitɨ Watsani kwieyari, tatsɨari 'Uhuki mɨra'aitakai naitɨ mɨkɨ kwieyari, yunɨtɨ Yahixi kiekariteya haika tewiyari mɨhɨkɨtɨkai.  
\v 31 Meta hixɨata'atɨ Karaha kwieyari, 'Atsitaruti meta 'Erurehi kwieyari, 'Uhuki mɨra'aitakai mɨkɨ Manatsexi nu'aya Makixi xiɨyarimama hixɨata me'atɨ wapiini katinayani, kememɨyupaɨmekai nuiwari.   
\p
\v 32 'Ikɨ mepɨhɨkɨ Muitsexi kwie kemɨtiwayetuiri Muhawi makuweri 'ukaitɨ Kurutani hatɨayari 'anutaɨye, Keriku 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie.  
\v 33 Peru Rewi xiɨyarimama Muitsexi kwie pɨkawayetuiri, Yawé, 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya wahetsie mɨmiemetɨkaikɨ, yaxeikɨa mɨkɨ kemɨtiwarahɨawekai.   
\c 14  
\s1 Kwie kemɨtiuti'inɨatsie Kurutani 'anataɨye  
\p
\v 1 'Ikɨ kwie Kanani mieme kanihɨkɨtɨni mawari wewiwame 'Eriyatsaxi, Kutsuhexi Nuni nu'aya meta 'Ixaheri nuiwaritemama wa'ukiyarima 'ixaheritsixi memɨwayetuiri.  
\v 2 Mɨkɨ kwie mekaniyetuiriyarieni Kakaɨyari 'inɨarieya mewewietɨ, 'atanauka heimana hixɨata memɨ'axe nuiwarite, mɨpaɨ mekateniuyurieni Yawé Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨa.  
\v 3-4 Mɨkɨri pɨwayetuiriekai kwie Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie mukuma huta nuiwariyari heimana hixɨata me'arɨkame, Kutse xiɨyarimama huta nuiwariyari mepɨhɨkɨtɨkai, Manatsexi meta 'Epɨrahini. Peru rewitsixi mepɨkayetuiriyarie kwie, 'etsiwa xeikɨa kiekari kwie heutinɨkame mana memɨte'utihɨwenikɨ meta memuka'etsanikɨ.  
\v 5 Mɨpaɨ 'ixaheritsixi kwie mekateniuti'inɨatsiyarieni Yawé kemainekai Muitsexi kemɨtiuta'aitɨa.   
\s1 Karewi Hewuruni kemɨtiyetuiriyarie  
\p
\v 6 Kura nuiwarimamata Kutsuhexi hetsɨa mekaniu'axɨani Kirikari mɨrakutewatsie. 'Ikɨ Keni tewiyari Karewi Kepune nu'aya Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe: «'Ekɨ kenaye'eri Yawé Muitsexi kemɨrahɨawekai, Kakaɨyari tewiyari, 'ahetsiemieme meta kemainekai nehetsiemieme Karetsi-Waxineya paitɨ.  
\v 7 Ne huta tewiyari wiyari nepexeiyakai kepauka Muitsexi Yawé mɨti'uximayatsiriwame Karetsi-Waxineya mɨrakutewatsie 'ukaitɨ mɨnetsihenɨ'a nemɨnierimiekɨ 'ikɨ kwie nemɨxeiyamiekɨ, yurikɨ ne nepɨreitaxatɨa ketita nemɨrexei.  
\v 8 Ta'iwama teyunaitɨ temekɨnekai, matsi hipatɨ xeikɨa mepɨwarutiwaɨripitɨa mewamariutatɨ wa'iyaritsie yu'iwama. Peru ne heitserie yanepɨtikamiekai Yawé nekakaɨyari hɨxie.  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Muitsexi mɨpaɨ kanetiniutahɨawe: “Kemɨ'ane kwieyaritsie pemekuyeixɨa mɨkɨ 'akwie kanayeimɨkɨ yuheyemekɨ meta 'axiɨyarima, matsi Yawé 'akakaɨyari pemanu'enikɨ”.   
\p
\v 10 »Huta tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi wiyari kananuyemieniri kepauka Yawé yurikɨ mɨpaɨ mutayɨ Muitsexi ya'utainekaku, 'ixaheritsixi makumawetsie te'u'uwakaku, hikɨ 'ena nepuwe nauka tewiyari heimana 'auxɨwi wiyari nehexeiyatɨ: Yawé 'ena 'akuxi pɨnetsi'uwitɨtɨyeika.  
\v 11 Yaxeikɨa nekatineu'erieka 'ana tukaritsie Muitsexi mɨnetsihenɨ'atsie hepaɨ. Yaxeikɨa nepɨtitɨrɨkaɨye mɨrayukwitɨnetsie 'ana hepaɨ.  
\v 12 'Ayumieme keneneyetuiri mɨkɨ kwie muhɨriya, Yawé kemɨnerahɨawekai 'ana. 'Anatɨtɨ mana mɨtiyehane 'ekɨ pekatinimaika kename 'anakitsixi mana mekutei, meta pekatinimaika wakiekari mɨmamariwawe 'aixɨa mɨreukunatɨka, peru matsi Yawé netsiparewiekaku nepɨyɨwe nemɨwara'iwakɨ, mɨkɨ kemɨnerahɨawekai».   
\p
\v 13 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi Kakaɨyari kaniutawawirieni Karewi 'aixɨa muyurienikɨ, Hewuruni kwieyari kaniyetuirieni.  
\v 14 Mana mɨtiyehane Hewuruni kwieyari Keni tewiyari Karewi kwieya kanayani Kepune nu'aya, Karewi Yawé manu'enikɨ, 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya.  
\v 15 Meripaitɨ Hewuruni katinitewakaitɨni Kiriati-'Ariwa, 'Ariwa titewatɨ mariwetɨ matɨakɨ 'anakitsixi teɨteriyari wa'ukiyari meripaitɨ.  
\p Mɨpaɨ tiuyɨkuri, naitsarie mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie kayuwatɨ 'umatɨ kanayani.   
\c 15  
\s1 Kura kwieyari  
\r (Kuts 15:15-19 – 'Its 1:11-15)  
\p
\v 1 Kwie Kura xiɨyarimama memɨyetuiriyarie kaniye'atɨkateitɨni 'Erumi kwieyari manuye'atɨkatei paitɨ, yunɨtɨ makumawetsie Tsini tatsutɨa meukayunetsie.   
\p
\v 2 Tatsutɨa muyekatsie kanitsutɨkaitɨni Haramara Mɨmɨki paitɨ,  
\v 3 kaniuyehanekaitɨni wahetɨa Terɨkaxi Memakuhe, makumawetsie Tsini kaniuyehanekaitɨni meta Karetsi-Waxineya wahetɨapaitɨ. Manata Ketsiruni, teikɨmana 'Araxi, nekutunikaitɨni Karika hepaɨtsita.  
\v 4 Manata 'Atsimuni meta 'Ekipitu 'akiyaritsie kanayenekaitɨni, haramara Meritexaniyutsie kaniye'akaitɨni. Mɨkɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni wahetɨa wakwie hakewa meuye'atɨkatei.   
\p
\v 5 Wakwie manuye'atɨkatei tau manatineika hepaɨtsita Haramara Mɨmɨki manuye'atɨka kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni, Kurutani hatuxameyari manuyeniere ye'atɨkaitɨ.  
\p Wakwie manuye'atɨka wayeta mieme kanitsutɨkaitɨni, Kurutani 'akiyari manuyeniere harakuna mɨmɨki mayematsie,  
\v 6 teikɨmana kaneutiyunekaitɨni Weti-Kukura manata teikɨmana Weti-'Arawa meta Wuhani Xuweni nu'aya 'aiyaritsie.  
\v 7 Manata Rewixi hepa, mayeweritsie 'Akuhuxi, kanekutunikaitɨni teikɨmana Kirikari hepatsie, 'Arumini hɨxie teikɨmana, mayeweritsie hetɨa. 'Enitsemetsi 'akiyari 'utɨa kaneutayunekaitɨni mana kaniye'akaitɨni 'Enixukeri paitɨ.  
\v 8 Manata mayeweri Weni-Hinuni hepaɨtsita kewutseutsixi wakiekari hetɨa tatsɨari Kerutsareme. Hɨritsie kaneutiyunekaitɨni mayeweri Hinuni 'utata, mayeweri Xepahini heima.  
\v 9 Mana hɨritsie wakwie kaneutayunekaitɨni haixa Netuhaki matiniere, manata kiekari mukumanetsie 'Epuruni hɨriyaritsie Wará paitɨ kaniye'atɨkateitɨni Kiriati-Yeharini titewakametsie.  
\v 10 Manata nekutunikaitɨni Wará hetɨa, Tsehixi hɨriyaritsie hepa kaneutayunekaitɨni, teikɨmana kaneutiyunekaitɨni Yeharini hɨriyari 'etsata kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, mɨtitewakai meta Ketsaruni, manata Weti-Tsemetsi hepatsie, Timinaha 'uyehanetɨ.  
\v 11 Manata 'Ekuruni heima, Wará hɨriyari warita kani'inɨaritɨkaitɨni, Tsikuruni paitɨ kaneutayunekaitɨni, Kawineri kaniye'atɨkateitɨni. Wakwie manuye'atɨka haramaratsie kaneukawekaitɨni.   
\p
\v 12 Wakwie manuye'atɨka tau manukayeika muyeka kani'inɨariyaritɨkaitɨni haramara Meritexaniyu.  
\p 'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni Kura xiɨyarimama wakwie kemɨreu'atɨkatei.   
\s1 Karewi, Hepuruni meta Rewixi kemɨtiwara'iwaxɨ  
\p
\v 13 Yawé kemainekai, Kutsuhexi Karewi Kepune nu'aya kwie yayeume kaniyetuirieni Kura kwieyaritsie mieme. Mɨkɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni Kiriati-'Ariwa, Hewuruni tɨtɨ ('Ariwa 'anakitsixi teɨteriyari wa'ukiyari kanayani).  
\v 14 Karewi yuhaikame kaniwara'iwa 'Epuruni kiekariyaritsie 'Anaki xiɨyarimama: Tsetsahi titewakame, 'Akimani meta Tarimahi.  
\v 15 Mana mɨyetɨa kananutiyani Rewixi kiekatari watakwinike, mɨkɨ kiekari meripaitɨ katinitewakaitɨni Kiriati-Tsepexi.  
\v 16 Mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni: «Kemɨ'ane 'uki kiekari Kiriati-Tsepexi mɨtamieni, neniwe nekaniwitɨtɨamɨkɨ 'Akatsa mɨtitewa».  
\v 17 Hikɨ 'Utunieri titewatɨ Kenatsi nu'aya Karewi matsuya Kiriati-Tsepexi kana'iwa 'ana 'Akatsa kaniutiwitɨni.   
\p
\v 18 Kepauka 'Akatsa munua, 'Utunieri mɨpaɨ katinitaxatɨani yupaapa kwie mɨtawawirienikɨ. 'Anakayaku yupuxutsie 'Akatsa, Karewi kanita'iwawiya:  
\p ―¿Ketita perayexeiya?   
\p
\v 19 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ rehɨawe:  
\p ―Neuxei tawarita neheima keneukaye'a, 'ariri Nekexi kwieyari pemɨnetsi'uxatɨa, hikɨta haixa 'ɨarime keneneuxatɨa.  
\p Mɨpaɨ Karewi yuniwe haixa katiniyetuirieni kanixatɨani hɨri 'amanutitewatsie meta muweritsie.   
\s1 Kura kiekariyari  
\p
\v 20 'Ikɨ pɨhɨkɨ kwie xapayari memɨyetuiriyarie Kura xiɨyarimama:   
\b  
\m
\v 21 Kiekarite watsutɨa miemete Kura nuiwariyari hetsiemieme, Nekexi kwieyaritsie miemete, 'Erumi kwieyari maka'atɨka:  
\pi1 Kawɨtseri, 'Eraxi, Kakuxi,  
\v 22 Kinaha, Rimuna, 'Arara,  
\v 23 Tseretsi, Katsuxi, 'Itinatsi,  
\v 24 Tsipi, Tereni, Weharuti,  
\v 25 Katsuxi-Karata, Keriuti, Ketsiruni (mɨmatiwatsiere Katsuxi),  
\v 26 'Amani, Tsema, Murara,  
\v 27 Katsaxi-Kara, Hetsimuni, Weti-Pereti,  
\v 28 Katsaxi-Tsuhari, Weritsewa, kiekari 'auriena mamanetɨka,  
\v 29 Wará, 'Ihini, 'Etseni,  
\v 30 'Eriturari, Ketsixi, Kuxima,  
\v 31 Tsikɨraki, Marimana, Tsanitsana,  
\v 32 Rewa'uti, Tsirikini, 'Ahini meta Ximuni, kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni, xeitewiyari heimana 'atanauka kiekarite yu'aurie heixeiyatɨkaime 'etsiyeyeume.   
\b  
\m
\v 33 Muweritsie:  
\pi1 'Etsitahuri, Tsura, 'Atsena,  
\v 34 Tsanuha, 'Enikanini, Tapuhaki, 'Enami,  
\v 35 Karimuti, 'Arurani, Tsuku, 'Atseka,  
\v 36 Tsakarahini, 'Aritahini, Kerera meta Kererutahini, tamamata heimana nauka kiekarite yu'aurie heixeiyatɨkaime 'etsiyeyeume.   
\pi1
\v 37 Tsenahani, Karatsa, Mirari-Kahari,  
\v 38 Rirehani, Mitsipa, Kuteri,  
\v 39 Rakixi, Wutsikati, 'Ekuruni,  
\v 40 Kawuni, Rakimatsi, Kitɨrixi,  
\v 41 Kereruti, Weti-Rakuni, Nuhama meta Makera, tatsɨari, tamamata heimana 'ataxewi kiekarite yu'aurie hexeiyatɨkaime 'etsiyeyeume.   
\pi1
\v 42 Riwina, 'Etexi, 'Atsani,  
\v 43 Kihita, 'Atsena, Netsiwi,  
\v 44 Kehira, 'Akitsiwi meta Maretsa, tatsuari, 'atanauka kiekarite yu'aurie hexeiyatɨkaime 'etsiyeyeume.   
\pi1
\v 45 'Ekuruni, meta kiekari 'auriena mamanetɨka,  
\v 46 mana haramara manuyekapaitɨ ye'atɨkaitɨ 'Atsiruri, meta kiekari 'etsimɨyeyeu,  
\v 47 'Atsiruri kiekari 'auriena mamanetɨka 'etsimɨyeyeu meta Kahatsa kiekari 'auriena mamanetɨka 'etsimɨyeyeu, 'Ekipitu 'akiyaritsie paitɨ meta mukuweritsie paitɨ haramara Meritexaniyu.   
\b  
\m
\v 48 Muhɨriyatsie:  
\pi1 Tsamixi, Katixi, Tsuku,  
\v 49 Rana, Kiriati-Tsana (mɨtimatiwatatsiere Rewixi),  
\v 50 'Anawi, 'Etsitemuha, 'Anini,  
\v 51 Kutseheni, Huruni meta Kiru, naitɨri tamamata heimana xewi kiekariyari heixeiyatɨkaime 'etsiyeyeume kiekari yu'aurie.   
\pi1
\v 52 'Arawi, Ruma, 'Etsani,  
\v 53 Yanuni, Weti-Tapuhaki, 'Apeka,  
\v 54 Humɨta, Kiriati-'Ariwa (mɨtitewatsiere Hewuruni) meta Tsihuxi, naitɨ 'atanauka kiekariyari 'etsiyeyeume hexeiyatɨkaime.   
\pi1
\v 55 Mahuni, Kaximeri, Tsipi, Yuta,  
\v 56 Ketsireri, Kurehani, Tsanuha,  
\v 57 Kahini, Kiweya meta Timinaha, naitɨri tamamata kiekariyari 'etsiyeyeume hexeiyakame yu'aurie.   
\pi1
\v 58 Karikuri, Wetsuxi, Keruxi,  
\v 59 Maharati, Weti-'Anuti meta 'Eritekuni, naitɨri 'ataxewitɨ kiekari yu'aurie heixeiyakame 'etsiyeyeume.   
\pi1
\v 60 Kiriati-Wahari (titewatɨtatsiere Kiriati-Yeharini) meta Xawaha, 'etsiyeyeume hexeiyakame kiekari.   
\b  
\m
\v 61 Makumawetsie:  
\pi1 Weti-'Arawa, Mirini, Tsekaka,  
\v 62 Niwitsani, Kiekari 'una maxuawe meta 'Enikari, naitɨri 'ataxewi paɨmetɨ kiekari, hexeiyatɨ kiekari 'etsiyeyeume yu'aurie.   
\p
\v 63 Kura xiɨyarimama mepɨka'uyɨwekaxɨa memɨwarayeweiyakɨ kewutseutsixi Kerutsareme kiekariyaritsie, hikɨ mɨkɨ mana mekanititeni Kura xiɨyarimama wahamatɨa.   
\c 16  
\s1 'Epɨrahini meta Manatsexi wakwie  
\p
\v 1 Kwie Kutse nuiwarimama wahetsiemieme kanitsutɨkaitɨni hatuxame Kurutanitsie, Keriku mieme haixa matinenieretsie 'aurie tau manatineika hepatsie, manata muhɨriyatsie Weteri kaneutiyunekaitɨni, meta makumawetsie.  
\v 2 Manata Weteri, manuyɨne Rutsi, 'arikitsixi wakwie makuma kaneutayunekaitɨni 'Atsitaruti paitɨ,  
\v 3 manata kapiretitsixi wakwie makuma hepatsie kaneutayunekaitɨni meta Weti-Kuruni hetɨa mieme kwieyaritsie metatsiere Ketsehexi, kaniye'akaitɨni haramaratsie Meritexaniyu.  
\v 4 Mɨpaɨ Manatsexi meta 'Epɨrahini wanuiwarima mekateniyetuiriyarieni mɨkɨ kwie, Kutse nuiwarimama.   
\s1 'Epɨrahini kwieyari  
\p
\v 5 'Ikɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni 'Epɨrahini xiɨyarimama memɨyetuiriyarie yuxexuitɨ:  
\p Tau manatineika hepatsie 'Ataruti-'Araxi tsutɨtɨ Weti-Kuruni yeta paitɨ ye'atɨkaime,  
\v 6 kaniye'atɨkateitɨni haramaratsie paitɨ Meritexaniyu. Mana Mikimetati, yeta mukuma, hekutunitɨ tau manatineika hepatsie kiekari Tanati-Tsiru makuma, Kanuha mɨtiyetewatsie kaniye'atɨkateitɨni.  
\v 7 Manata kanatinekaitɨni Kanuha 'Atsitaruti meta Nara paitɨ, Keriku 'uyekaitɨ hatuxame Kurutani ye'atɨkaime.  
\v 8 Meta Tapuhaki kaniuyehanekaitɨni tau makayuyuipike 'aki Kanaha manuyekatsie, haramara Meritexaniyutsie kaniye'atɨkateitɨni. Mɨkɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni memɨyetuiriyarie 'Epɨrahini xiɨyarimama.  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ kwie tsiere neutinɨkaitɨni kiekari meta 'auriena mamanetɨka Manatsexi kwieyatsie mieme.   
\p
\v 10 Mɨkɨ 'Epɨrahini xiɨyarimama Kananeutsixi mepɨkawarayewei Ketsehexi memukutekai, wahamatɨa memu'uwanikɨ mekaniwarupitɨani, hikɨ tukaritsie kemɨtiyɨane hepaɨ, meteniwaruta'uximayatsitɨani waɨriyarika mewapitɨatɨ.   
\c 17  
\s1 Manatsexi kwieyari  
\p
\v 1 Metatsiere Manatsexi kaniuxatɨarieni kwie yuxaɨta meixeiyanikɨ, Kutse mɨmatɨarieyatɨkaikɨ. Makixi, Manatsexi matɨarieya Karaharitsixi pɨwatutsitɨkai, kaniuxatɨarieni Karaha meta Watsani mukuyatɨkaikɨ.  
\v 2 Hipatɨta Manatsexi xiɨyarimama yaxeikɨa mekaniuxatɨarieni yukwie: 'Awihetsexi, Kere, 'Atsirieri, Tsikeni, Hepexi meta Tsemira. Mɨkɨ Manatsexi mekanixiɨyarimamatɨkaitɨni Kutse nu'aya.   
\p
\v 3 Mɨpaɨ katiniɨyɨni Tserupekari Hepexi niweya, Karaha teukarieya, Manatsexi tutsieya, 'ukari xeikɨa kaniwarayexeiya, mɨpaɨ mekatenitetewakaitɨni: Makira, Nuha, Kukɨra, Mirika meta Tiritsa.  
\v 4 Mɨkɨ mawari wewiwame 'Eriyatsaxi hɨxie mekaniti'uni, meta Kutsuhexi hɨxie Nuni nu'aya meta 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima wahɨxie, mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe: «Yawé mɨpaɨ Muitsexi katiniuta'aitɨani kename kwie xetatsiyetuirienikekai tahetsiemieme mayanikɨ». Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni Yawé kemutayɨkai.   
\p
\v 5 Manatsexi xiɨyarimama mekaniuxatɨarieni tamamata wahetsiemieme, Karaha meta Watsani teka'inɨatatɨ, Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie mɨti'ane.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨtɨtɨ mɨpaɨ pɨtiuyɨ Manatsexi niwemama 'ukarawetsixi mepɨyetuiriyarie, 'ukitsi tekawa'inɨatatɨ memuxatɨarie. Hipatɨta Manatsexi xiɨyarimama Karaha kwieyari mekaniuxatɨarieni.   
\p
\v 7 Manatsexi kwieyari mɨpaɨ kaniyeukaitɨni tsutɨtɨ 'Atsexi, Mikimetati ye'atɨkaitɨ, mɨkɨ pukumakai Tsikeni 'aurie tau manatineika hepatsie. Manata ye'atɨkaitɨ tatsutɨa neukayunekaitɨni, Yatsuwi kwieyaritsie paitɨ Tapuhaki mɨrakutewatsie.  
\v 8 Manatsexi Tapuhaki kwieyari katinipiinieyatɨkaitɨni, mɨkɨta Tapuhaki kiekariyari 'Epɨrahini xiɨyarimama pɨta katiniwapiinitɨkaitɨni, Manatsexi kwieyari maka'atɨkatsie mukumakaikɨ.  
\v 9 Mana ye'atɨkaitɨ kaniumiekaitɨ watsutɨa, wayetata 'aki manuyeka Kanaha heukayunetɨ haramara Meritexaniyu. Muwa mɨtiuyehane waɨkawa kiekari 'Epɨrahini hetsɨa miemete mekaniuyutinɨni kiekari Manatsexi hetsɨa miemete wahamatɨa.  
\v 10 Watsutɨa mieme kwie 'Epɨrahini tinipiinieyatɨkaitɨni, Manatsexi meta wayeta mieme kwie. Manatsexi kwieya niye'atɨkateitɨni haramara Meritexaniyutsie 'Atsexi kwieya maye'atɨka kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, meta tau manatineika hepatsie 'Itsakaxi kwieya maka'atɨkatsie.  
\v 11 'Itsakaxi kwieya maka'atɨka meta 'Atsexi mɨkɨ wahixɨapa, Manatsexi xiɨyarimama kiekari mekanexeiyakaitɨni yu'aurie heixeiyakame 'etsiyeyeume: Wetsehani, 'Iwurehami, Ruxi, 'Eniruxi, Tanaki meta Mekiru. Xapatsie mɨka'uxa hairiekatsie kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni Naputi.   
\p
\v 12 Manatsexi xiɨyarimama 'ikɨ kiekaritsie mepɨkatiyaxixɨ, kananeutsixi memɨka'itauniekaikɨ mɨkɨ kiekarite.  
\v 13 Kepauka 'ixaheritsixi waukawa memakɨ, mekateniwaruta'aitɨani mɨkɨ kananeutsixi, peru mepɨka'uyɨwekaxɨa memɨwarayenɨ'anikɨ yuheyemekɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Kutse nuiwarimama Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ mekateniutahɨawe:  
\p ―¿Titayari kwie 'etsiyeume xeikɨa xetate'uxatɨa? tame tepɨtamɨire, Yawé waɨkawa 'aixɨa pɨtatsiyurie.   
\p
\v 15 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p ―Metsɨ xeniu xekaniyuwaɨkawani 'etsitiyewata 'Epɨrahini hɨriyari, xekenehu kɨyexi 'amupapameyatsie peretseutsixi meta xepahitsixi wakwieyaritsie, mana xewatatɨwetɨ xekenetiteni.   
\p
\v 16 Kutse xiɨyarimamata mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Mɨkɨ kwie muhɨriya 'etsipɨyewa, manata kananeutsixi memɨtitei kaxetate tepɨakɨ memɨwewiyatɨka mepɨwarexeiya, Wetsahani kiekatari tsiere kiekari 'auriena mamanetɨka tatsɨari mayeweri Ketsireri.   
\p
\v 17 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi 'Epɨrahini meta Manatsexi nuiwarimama waɨkawa kaniwarutuika, Kutse nuiwarimama:  
\p ―Xeme xekaniyumɨireni waɨkawa tɨrɨkariya xekanexeiyani. Mɨkɨ kwie xeikɨa xehexeiyatɨ xepɨka'akɨne,  
\v 18 matsi hɨritsie muhukuyatsie xehetsiemieme kanayeimɨkɨ. Xekenetawata mana xekenetiyaxi mɨkɨ kwieyari hakewa meuka'atɨka. Tsepanetɨ kananeutsixi kaxetate tepɨakɨ memɨwewiyatɨka memɨwarexeiya, xeme xekaniwarayeweiyakuni.   
\c 18  
\s1 Hipatɨ wakwie  
\p
\v 1 Kepauka mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie 'ixaheritsixi memɨte'uta'aitaxɨ, yunaitɨ mekaniuyukuxeɨrieni Tsiru mɨrakutewatsie, 'ixuriki tukiyari manuwekai.  
\v 2 'Ana tukaritsie 'akuxi mekaniyuhayewatɨwekaitɨni me'atahutatɨ wa'iwama mekaheixeiyatɨ yukwie.   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ 'ixaheritsixi katiniwarutahɨawe: «¿Kepaukake xeme yukwietsie xepɨyehu Yawé mɨxexatɨa xe'ukiyarima wakakaɨyari?  
\v 4 Yuhahaikakame xekeniwarutihɨawixɨa nemɨwaranɨnɨ'anikɨ memɨnieriyukɨ xapatsie memɨte'aka'utɨanikɨ. Me'axɨame,  
\v 5 mekaniti'inɨatakuni kwie 'atahuta paɨmeme. Kura xehetɨa kanikunakamɨkɨ yukwie, Kutse xiɨyarimamata wayeta.  
\v 6 Kepauka xemeinɨni xe'i'utɨatɨ xekeneneyetuiri, nekanixeyetuiriemɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ kemɨ'anetsie mɨtinake Yawé hɨxie takakaɨyari.  
\v 7 Xekatenimaikari, rewitsixi kwie mepɨkayetuiriyarieni nixewitɨ tɨma, mɨkɨ pɨta 'uximayatsika memɨyetuiriyariekɨ mawari wewiwamete memɨhɨkɨtɨnikɨ Yawé hetsiemieme. Meta Kahari, Xuweni meta hixɨapa memɨ'axe Manatsexi wanuiwarima 'ari mekaniyetuiriyarieni yukwie Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie. Muitsexi Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame kaniwayetuirieni wapiini mɨrayanikɨ».   
\p
\v 8 Kepauka 'ukitsi memuyuha'aritɨakai menieriyuka mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie, Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Naime kwie xekenexeiya ya'ane xepɨnetsi 'atɨirieni xapatsie raye'ukame. Kepauka xemɨ'axɨani 'ena Tsiru, ne 'inɨarikɨ kwie nepɨxeta'iwitsitɨani Yawé hɨxie».  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ yametenikakɨne Kutsuhexi kemainekai, mekanakunuaxɨani Tsirutsie xapa mehahurietɨ raye'ukame, kiekari kemɨreumanetɨkatei meta 'atahuta tapari kwie 'inɨariyari.  
\v 10 Kutsuhexi mana kaniwaruta'iwitsitɨani Yawé hɨxie, kaniwaruxatɨani kwie mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi, kememuyukupapaɨmekai nuiwarite.   
\s1 Wenikamini kwieya  
\p
\v 11 Wenikamini xiɨyarimama mekaniuxatɨarieni kememuyupaɨmekai niwemama. Mɨkɨ kwieyari kanikumakaitɨni Kura kwieyari makuma meta Kutse xiɨyarimama wakwie makuma wahixɨapa.   
\p
\v 12 Wakwie manuye'atɨka katini'anekaitɨni haa manuyeka Kurutani, meta Keriku heima kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, hɨritsie kaneutiyunekaitɨni, makumawetsie Weti-'Aweni ye'atɨkaitɨ.  
\v 13 Rutsi mɨrakutewa kaneuyeyunekaitɨni, meta Weteri mɨrakutewa, 'Ataruti-'Araxi mɨrakutewapai heutayunetɨ, Weti-Kuruni tsutɨa mukuma hɨriyaritsie heutayunetɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Manata hɨkɨa pɨta kaneukayunekaitɨni, tau manukayuyuipiketsie, ye'atɨkaitɨ Kiriati-Wahari, mɨtitewatsiere Kiriati-Yeharini, mɨkɨ Kiekari Kura mɨrawiya pɨhɨkɨtɨkai. 'Ikɨ pɨhɨkɨ tau makayuyuipike muyeka.   
\p
\v 15 Tsutɨa muyekatsie nitsutɨkaitɨni Kiriati-Yeharini, tau makayuyuipiketsie, manata haixa matiniere Netuhaki ye'atɨ.  
\v 16 Weni-Hinuni hɨriyaritsie kaniukuhanekaitɨni, Xepahini mɨrayetewa heima. Hinuni mayeweritsie kaniuyehanekaitɨni, Kewutseutsixi wakiekari 'aurie mukɨatsarietsie, 'Enixukeri haixayari matiniere paitɨ kaniye'akaitɨni.  
\v 17 Manata kanititunekaitɨni teikɨmana hautiyunetɨ, 'Enitsemetsi kiekari makuma hepa, Keriruti kaniuyehanekaitɨni, 'Arumini hɨxie kaniuyehanekaitɨni, Wuhani Xuweni nu'aya 'aiyaritsie kaneukayunekaitɨni.  
\v 18 Manata kaneutayunekaitɨni hɨri matitei yeta, Weti-'Arawa mɨrayetewatsie hɨxie, manata 'Arawa mayeweritsie kaneukayunekaitɨni.  
\v 19 Manata Weti-Kukura yeta, manata mukuweritsie yeta Haramara Mɨmɨki hatetsitayaritsie, tatsɨari hatuxame Kurutani manuyenieretsie. Mɨkɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni kwie kemɨreu'atɨka wahetɨatsie.   
\p
\v 20 Kurutani hatuxameyari kani'inɨaritɨkaitɨni kemɨreukatei, kwie kemɨreu'atɨkatei tau manatineika hepatsie.  
\p 'Ikɨ kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni Wenikamini xiɨyarimama wakwie kemɨreu'atɨkatei.   
\p
\v 21 Wenikamini xiɨyarimama 'ikɨ kiekaritsie mekaniuyuhayewa: Keriku, Weti-Kukura, 'Emeki-Katsitsi,  
\v 22 Weti-'Arawa, Tsemarahini, Weteri,  
\v 23 'Awini, Paraha, 'Upɨra,  
\v 24 Kepaxi-'Amuni, 'Uhuni meta Kehewa, naitɨri tamamata heimana huta kiekariyari yu'aurie heixeiyatɨ 'etsiyeyeume.  
\v 25 Meta Kawahuni, Xama, Weruti,  
\v 26 Mitsipa, Kapira, Mutsa,  
\v 27 Xekeni, 'Ixiperi, Tarara,  
\v 28 Tsera, 'Erepa, Kewutsi, mɨtitewatsiere Kerutsareme, Kiweya, meta Kiriati, naitɨ tamamata heimana nauka kiekariyari yu'aurie heixeiyakame 'etsiyeyeume.  
\p 'Ikɨ memɨteyetuiriyarie Wenikamini xiɨyarimama yuxexuitɨ mepɨhɨkɨ.   
\c 19  
\s1 Tsimehuni kwieya  
\r (Kuts 19:2-10 – 1Kem 4:28-33)  
\p
\v 1 Tsimehuni xiɨyarimama hutarieka miemete kwie memɨyetuiriyarie mekanakɨne, mɨkɨ wakwie Kura kwieyari taɨta kaniyemakaitɨni.  
\v 2 'Ikɨ kiekari hetsiena mieme kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni: Weritsewa, (Tsawa tsiere manɨyɨne), Murara,  
\v 3 Katsaxi-Tsuhari, Wara, 'Etseni,  
\v 4 'Eriturari, Weturi, Kuxima,  
\v 5 Tsikɨraki, Weti-Marikawuti, Katsaxi-Tsutsa,  
\v 6 Weti-Rewahuti, meta Tsarukeni, naitɨ kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni tamamata heimana haika kiekariyari 'auriena hamanetɨkaitɨ,  
\v 7 meta 'Ahini, Ximuni, 'Etexi, meta 'Atsani, naitɨ nauka kiekariyari yu'aurie heixeiyakame.  
\v 8 Metatsiere kiekarite mumanetɨkatei Waratiwexi kiekariyari makuma paitɨ memu'axe, Xamati mɨrakutewatatsiere Nekexi kwieyaritsie.  
\p Mɨkɨ kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni kwie Tsimehuni xiɨyarimama mɨwahetsiemiemetɨkai.  
\v 9 Kura kwieyari 'akaniyeukaitɨni matsi kememɨyupaɨmekai xiɨyarimama, 'ayumieme Tsimehuni xiɨyarimama 'etsiyeume mekaniuxatɨarieni Kura kwieyaritsie mieme.   
\s1 Tsawuruni kwieya  
\p
\v 10 Tsawuruni xiɨyarimama hairieka miemete mekanakɨne kwie memɨyetuiriyarietsie. Wakwie manu'axe Tsari katinakutewakaitɨni.  
\v 11 Tau makayuyuipike hepatsie kaneutayunekaitɨni Mararaha mɨrakutewatsie, kaniye'akaitɨni Rawetseti, 'aki manuyeka paitɨ Kunehani hɨxie.  
\v 12 Manata Tsari mɨrakutewatsie kaneutayunekaitɨni, tau manatineika hepatsie, 'atsita Kitsiruti-Tawuxi kwieyaritsie paitɨ, manata Tawerati paitɨ, manata teikɨmana kaneutiyunekaitɨni Kapiha paitɨ.  
\v 13 Manata kaniuye'atɨkateitɨni Kati-Kepexi heutayunetɨ metatsiere 'Itakatsini, Ximuni paitɨ ye'atɨ Neka mɨrakutewatsie yetunitɨ.  
\v 14 Manatatsiere nekutunekaitɨni teikɨmana Kanatuni ye'atɨ, Keteri kaniunɨkaitɨni mayeweritsie.  
\v 15 Mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie tamamata heimana huta kiekariyari kanikumanekaitɨni, mɨkɨ wahamatɨa Katati, Narari, Tsimiruni, 'Irara meta Wereni.  
\v 16 'Ikɨ kwie kanihɨkɨtɨni Tsawuruni xiɨyarimama wahetsiemieme memɨyetuiriyarie, kiekarite heutinɨkame meta 'etsimɨyeyeukai.   
\s1 'Itsakaxi kwieyari  
\p
\v 17 'Itsakaxi xiɨyarimama naurieka mekanakɨne yukwie memɨyetuiriyarietsie, kememɨyupaɨmekai.  
\v 18 Mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie kiekari mukumanekai kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni: Ketsireri, Ketsuruti, Tsuneni,  
\v 19 Kaparahini, Tsikuni, 'Anakarati,  
\v 20 Xawiti, Tsitsuni, 'Awetsi,  
\v 21 Xemeti, 'Enikanini, 'Enara meta Weti-Patsetsi.  
\v 22 Wakwie kaniye'atɨkateitɨni Tawuxi paitɨ, Tsakatsima meta Weti-Tsemetsi, haa manuyeka heukayunetɨ Kurutani. Naitɨ, tamamata heimana 'ataxewi kiekariyari  
\v 23 'Itsakaxi xiɨyarimama kaniwahetsiemiemetɨkaitɨni.   
\s1 'Atsexi kwieyari  
\p
\v 24 'Atsexi xiɨyarimama 'auxɨwirieka kwie memɨyetuiriyarie mekanakɨne.  
\v 25 Mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie kiekari kanikumanekaitɨni Kerikati, Kari, Weteni, 'Akitsahapi,  
\v 26 'Aramereki, 'Amari meta Mitsehari. Wakwie kaniye'atɨkateitɨni, tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, Kaximeru hɨriyaritsie meta Tsikuxi-Riwinati.  
\v 27 Manata nekutunikaitɨni tau manatineika hepatsie Weti-Rakuni hepatsie meta kaniye'akaitɨni Tsawuruni, Keteri mayeweritsie. Manata teikɨmana Weti-'Emeki meta Neyeheri, kaniutihanekaitɨni Kawuri mɨrakutewatsie 'aurie.  
\v 28 Manata 'Awuruni hepatsie, Xekuwi, Hamuni meta Kanaha, meta kiekari mɨmariwe Tsiruni paitɨ mukuma.  
\v 29 Manata nekutunikaitɨni Xama hepaɨtsita, manata kiekari Tiru mɨtɨrɨkaɨye. Manata nekutunikaitɨni Kutsa mɨrayetewatsie manata haramaratsie Meritexaniyu.  
\v 30 Naitɨ kanayeikakaitɨni xeitewiyari heimana huta, naitɨ 'inɨaritɨ Makarewi, 'Akitsiwi, 'Uma, 'Apeki meta Xekuwi.  
\v 31 'Ikɨ kwie 'Atsexi xiɨyarimama memɨyetuiriyarie kanihɨkɨni, kiekarite heutinɨkame meta 'etsimɨyeyeu.   
\s1 Nepɨtahari kwieyari  
\p
\v 32 'Ataxewirieka mekanakɨne Nepɨtahari xiɨyarimama kwie memɨyetuiriyarietsie.  
\v 33 Wakwie kaniye'atɨkateitɨni Kerepi tsutɨtɨ meta kɨye 'amupa Tsananini manuwe, 'Araminekewi hepatsie kaneutayunekaitɨni meta Kawineri hepatsie, manata Rakuni hepatsie 'atsita haa Kurutani manuyeka.  
\v 34 Wakwie manuye'atɨkatei tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, kaniuyehanekaitɨni 'Atsinuti-Tawuxi, meta kaniuyehanekaitɨni Hukuki. Tsawuruni kwieyari 'aurie kaniuyehanekaitɨni tatsutɨa hepatsie, meta 'Atsexi kwieyari maka'atɨkatsie kaniuyehanekaitɨni tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, metatsiere hatuxame Kurutani manutika kaniuti'atɨkateitɨni tau manatineika hepatsie.  
\v 35 Kiekari mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie mukumanekai mɨtɨrɨkawi kanihɨkɨtɨkaitɨni: Tsirini, Tsexi, Kamati, Xakati, Kinereti,  
\v 36 'Aramaha, Xama, Katsuxi,  
\v 37 Tseretsi, 'Erurehi, 'Enikatsuxi,  
\v 38 'Iruni, Mirari-'Eri, Kureni, Weti-'Anati meta Weti-Tsemetsi. Naitɨ tamamata heimana 'atanauka kanayeikani yu'aurie heixeiyakame 'etsiyeyeume.  
\v 39 'Ikɨ kwie Nepɨtahari xiɨyarimama memɨyetuiriyarie kanihɨkɨtɨni naitɨ kiekarite meta 'etsimɨyeyeu yɨnɨkame.   
\s1 Rani kwieyari  
\p
\v 40 'Atahutarieka kanayani Rani xiɨyarimama kepauka kwie memɨyetuiriyarie.  
\v 41 Niyunɨkaitɨni Tsura kwieyari, 'Etsitahuri, 'Ixi-Tsemetsi,  
\v 42 Tsakariwini, 'Ayaruni, Ketura,  
\v 43 'Eruni, Timinati, 'Ekuruni,  
\v 44 'Eriteke, Kiwetuni, Warati,  
\v 45 Kehu, Wene-Weraki, Kahati-Ximuni,  
\v 46 Mekarikuni meta Xakuni, kwie Kupe hɨxie mukumakai.   
\p
\v 47 Rani xiɨyarimama mekate'unakeka kwie keyeume memuxatɨariekai, Retseni kiekariyaritsie mekanekɨne. Kepauka mana memu'axɨa yunaime mekaniwarukwini mana kiekatari. Hikɨ mana Rani xiɨyarimama mekanitiyaxe Rani mekateniterɨwa kiekari, yututsi mema'eriwanikɨ.  
\v 48 Mɨpaɨ katiniumare Rani xiɨyarimama wakwie, naitɨ kiekarite meta 'etsimɨyeyeu.   
\s1 Kutsuhexi kwieya  
\p
\v 49 Kepauka mɨtiutahayewaxɨ kwie wayetuiriwatɨ kemɨ'ane mɨwahetsiemiemetɨkai, teɨteri 'ixaheritsixi Kutsuhexi Nuni nu'aya kwie mekaniyetuirieni hetsiena mɨmiemetɨnikɨ.  
\v 50 Mɨpaɨ mekatenaye'atɨani Yawé kemainekai. Kutsuhexi kaniyetuiriyarieni kiekari Timinati-Tsera, 'Epɨrahini muhɨriyatsie mɨkamakai. Mɨkɨ kanita'iwaukaitɨni, 'aixɨa kaniyurieni mana 'ukaitɨ kanayani.   
\p
\v 51 Mɨpaɨ mekateniutahayewa kwie mewayetuiriwatɨ mɨkɨ mawari wewiwame 'Eriyatsaxi, Kutsuhexi meta 'ukirawetsixi 'ixaheritsixi. Mɨkɨ 'inɨarikɨ memɨteyuriekai Tsiru mɨrakutewatsie mekateniyuriekaitɨni, Yawé hɨxie, 'Ixuriki Tukiyari mɨranutakɨkatɨretsie.   
\c 20  
\s1 Kiekarite memɨwayuti'awiwieta  
\p
\v 1 Yawé Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniutahɨawe:  
\v 2 «'Ixaheritsixi mɨpaɨ ketiniwarutahɨawi kiekarite hipame memɨtixatakɨ muwa memɨyuti'awiwietanikɨ, kenemutayɨ Muitsexi 'uyeikakaku 'akuxi.  
\v 3 Mɨpaɨ xɨka kemɨ'ane mɨtiyumieni ka'imaime mɨkɨ 'ana muwa muyuti'awieta pɨyɨweni mɨkɨ kiekaritetsie 'iya yaxeikɨa 'iyurienike mumierie 'iwaya 'iweiyakaku.   
\p
\v 4 »Kemɨ'ane muyuta'una mɨkɨ xeime kiekaritsie, mana kitenie kaniyutaxatamɨkɨ kemɨtiuyuri naime 'ukirawetsixi mana kiekatari wahɨxie. Mɨkɨ 'ukirawetsixi mekanitanaki'erikuni mana kiekaritsie mekanixatɨakuni kii wahamatɨa muyeikanikɨ.  
\v 5 Xɨka 'enukuweiya xewitɨ 'imienike mɨrapinekɨ, xɨka mɨkɨ kiekaritsie ye'ani 'ukirawetsixi mepɨka'iyetuirieni, mɨkɨ 'ari memitanaki'eriekaikɨ mɨtiuyumi ka'imaika nitixaɨtɨ karayexeiyatɨ hamatɨana.  
\v 6 Mɨkɨ hetsiena mɨrahɨiwa mana kaniyuhayewakamɨkɨ kiekaritsie kepaukake yunaime teɨteri wahɨxie muyutaxata yamemɨtehetimanikɨ hetsiena mieme 'aixɨa mɨtiyɨnikɨ meta kepaukake mɨkɨ mawari wewiwamete tiwa'aitɨwame mɨmɨni. 'Anake heitserie pexeiyani hetsiena mɨrahɨiwa munuanikɨ yukie meta yukiekaritsie hakewa meyuta'unakai meripaitɨ».   
\p
\v 7 Kutsuhexi kemɨtiu'aitakai mekatenaye'atɨani, 'ixaheritsixi kiekari mekaniutixata Tseretsi Karereya mɨrawiya Nepɨtahari kwieyaritsie muhɨriyatsie, Tsikeni 'Epɨrahini kwieyaritsie muhɨriyatsie, meta Kiriati-'Ariwa mɨpaɨ pɨtimatiwata Hewuruni Kura kwieyaritsie muhɨriyatsie.  
\v 8 Kurutani 'anutaɨye, haika kiekariteyari mekaniutixata: Wetsexi, makumawetsie meta makuweritsie mukuma Xuweni kwieyaritsie, Xamuti Karaha kwieyaritsie, Kahari xiɨyarimama wakwietsie, meta Kurani Watsani kwieyaritsie Manatsexi kwieyaritsie.  
\v 9 Yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi yatɨni 'ateewa kiekatari kemɨ'ane mɨtiyumieni ka'imaime muyuta'una pɨyɨweni mɨkɨ kiekaritetsie, mɨka'imienikɨ kemɨ'ane mikuwaune 'imienike, meka'itaxanetawekaku 'akuxi teɨteri memayuxeɨrietsie.   
\c 21  
\s1 Rewitsixi wakiekarite  
\r (Kuts 21:4-39 – 1Kem 6:54-80)  
\p
\v 1 Rewitsixi wa'ukiyarima 'ahurawa mekaniukɨne 'Eriyatsaxi hetsɨa meta Kutsuhexi Nuni nu'aya hetsɨa meta memanuyetei 'ixaheritsixi waxiɨyarima wahetsɨa,  
\v 2 Tsirutsie memɨyuxeɨriekai yunaitɨ, Kanani kwieyaritsie mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe: «Yawé mɨpaɨ pɨtiu'aitaxɨ Muitsexi mɨpaɨ pɨtiutahɨawixɨ, kename xeme xetatsixatɨanikekai kiekarite mana temɨtitenikɨ, meta tatewama wakwie mana memu'uwanikɨ».   
\p
\v 3 Hikɨ 'ixaheritsixi, Yawé kemainekai mekateniwayetuirieni yupiini, 'ikɨ kiekarite meta kwie hakewa memɨtehetahɨni mɨkɨ rewitsixi:   
\p
\v 4 Matɨari memɨyetuiriyarie yukiekari, mekaniyuta'iwa mɨkɨ rewitsixi Kuhati xiɨyarimama mekanakɨne. 'Ikɨ mawari wewiwame 'Aruni xiɨyarimama mekaniyetuiriyarieni tamamata heimana haikame, Kura, Tsimehuni meta Wenikamini kwieyaritsie miemete.  
\v 5 Hipatɨta memɨyuhayewaxɨ Kuhati xiɨyarimama mekaniyetuiriyarieni tamamata kiekarite 'Epɨrahini, Rani kwieyaritetsie meta hixɨapa memɨ'axe Manatsexi xiɨyarimama wakwietsie.   
\p
\v 6 Keritsuni xiɨyarimama mekaniyetuiriyarieni, 'inɨarikɨ, tamamata heimana haika kiekariyari 'Itsakaxi, 'Atsexi meta Nepɨtahari wakwieyaritsie metatsiere Manatsexi xiɨyarimama hixɨapa memɨ'axe wakwieyaritsie Watsani mɨrakutewatsie.   
\p
\v 7 Merari xiɨyarimama tamamata heimana huta kiekariyari mekaniyetuiriyarieni, Xuweni, Kahari metatsiere Tsawuruni xiɨyarimama wakwieyaritsie.   
\p
\v 8 Mɨpaɨ mekateniuyurieni 'ixaheritsixi mekaniwaruxatɨani kiekarite meta kwie hakewa memɨtehetahɨnikekai mɨkɨ rewitsixi, Yawé Muitsexi kemɨrahɨawekai.   
\p
\v 9 Yaxeikɨa katiniɨyɨni Kura xiɨyarimama wakwietsie meta Tsimehuni.  
\v 10 Kiekarite kemɨ'ane mutaxatsie 'Aruni nuiwarieya Kuhati xiɨyarimama wahetsie katiniunake, mɨkɨ wahetsie meri mɨtiunakixɨkɨ 'inɨari.  
\v 11 Mɨkɨ mekaniuxatɨarieni Kiriati-'Ariwa, tatsɨari Hewuruni, heuyutinɨkame kwie hakewa tewaxi memɨwaretahɨnikɨ, hɨritsie Kura kwieyaritsie ('Ariwa 'anakitsixi watutsi patɨa).  
\v 12 'Epuruni 'aurie kiekari mamanetɨkatei meta kwie, mepɨka'uxatɨarie rewitsixi, meripaitɨri kaniuxatɨariekaitɨni Karewi Kepune nu'aya.   
\p
\v 13 Mɨkɨta Hewuruni (kiekari wahetsie mɨrahɨiwa memuyename), 'Aruni xiɨyarimama mekaniuxatɨarieni mɨkɨ kiekari heuyutinɨkame kwie mɨratihɨriwa: Riwina,  
\v 14 Katixi, 'Etsitemuha,  
\v 15 Huruni, Rewixi,  
\v 16 'Ahini, Yutahu meta Weti-Tsemetsi, 'atanauka kiekarite naitɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni.  
\v 17 Wenikamini kwieyaritsie mekaniuxatɨarieni kiekarite kwie heuyutinɨkame: Kawahuni, Kehewa,  
\v 18 'Anatuti meta 'Arimuni, nauka kiekariyaritsie.  
\v 19 Naitɨ kanakɨne tamamata heimana haika kiekariyari kwie mɨratihɨriwa heuyutinɨkame mawari wewiwamete memɨyetuiriyarie 'Aruni nuiwarimama.   
\p
\v 20 Memuyuhayewaxɨ rewitsixi Kuhati nuiwarimama mekaniuxatɨarieni kiekari 'Epɨrahini kwieyaritsie.  
\v 21 'Epɨrahini hɨriyaritsie mekaniuxatɨarieni kiekari Tsikeni, kiekarite memayuti'awiwieta teɨteri teyukwikate. Yaxeikɨatsiere mekaniuxatɨarieni Ketsehexi,  
\v 22 meta Kiwɨtsahini metatsiere Weti-Kuruni, nauka kiekariyari kanayani kwie hexeiyakame hakewa memɨtehetihɨweni.  
\v 23 Rani kwieyaritsieta mekaniuxatɨarieni 'Eriteke, Kiwetuni,  
\v 24 'Ayaruni, meta Kahati-Ximuni, nauka kiekariyari kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani.  
\v 25 Manatsexi xiɨyarimama hixɨapa memɨ'axe wakwietsie mekaniuxatɨarieni, Tanaki meta Kahati-Ximuni, huta kiekariyari kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani.  
\v 26 Naitɨ kanayani tamamata kiekariyari kwie heuyutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani, mekaniuxatɨarieni Kuhati xiɨyarimama memɨyuhayewakai.   
\p
\v 27 Rewitsixi Keritsuni nuiwarimama mekaniuxatɨarieni huta kiekariyari kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani, Manatsexi xiɨyarimama hixɨapa memɨ'axe wakwietsie: Kurani Watsani kwieyaritsie (kiekari memayuti'awiwieta teyukwikate memuyenametsie) meta Wetsitera.  
\v 28 'Itsakaxi xiɨyarimama wakwietsie mekaniuxatɨarie Tsitsuni, Tawerati,  
\v 29 Karimuti meta 'Enikanini, mɨyatɨtɨ nauka kiekariyari kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani.  
\v 30 'Atsexi xiɨyarimama wakwietsie, rewitsixi mekaniuxatɨarieni Mitsehari, 'Awuruni,  
\v 31 Kerikati meta Xekuwi, naitɨ nauka kiekariyari kanayani kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani.  
\v 32 Nepɨtahari xiɨyarimama wakwieyaritsie mekaniuxatɨarieni haika kiekariyari kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani: Tseretsi (kiekari memayuti'awiwieta Karereya kwieyaritsie), meta kiekarite Kamuti-Ruxi meta Kaxitani.  
\v 33 Naitɨ kanayani tamamata heimana haika kiekariyari kwie heuyutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani memuxatɨarie rewitsixi Keritsuni xiɨyarimama.   
\p
\v 34 Mɨkɨ Merari xiɨyarieya, rewitsixi nuiwariyari wa'iwama, Tsawuruni xiɨyarimama wahetsɨa mekaniuxatɨarieni nauka kiekariyari, kwie heutinɨkame mɨratihɨriwani: Kunehani, Kaxita,  
\v 35 Rimina, meta Narari.  
\v 36 Xuweni xiɨyarimama wakwieyaritsie mekaniuxatɨarieni nauka kiekariyari kwie mɨratihɨriwani heutinɨkame: Wetsexi, Yahatsa,  
\v 37 Karemuti, meta Mepati.  
\v 38 Kahari xiɨyarimama wakwieyaritsie mekaniuxatɨarieni nauka kiekariyari kwie mɨratihɨriwani heuyutinɨkame: Xamuti-Karaha (kiekari memayuti'awiwieta memuyenametsie), Makanahini,  
\v 39 Hetsiwuni, metatsiere Katsexi.  
\v 40 Mɨpaɨ mekaniɨyɨni rewitsixi Merari xiɨyarimama, 'imaturieka nuiwari kiekari memɨyetuiriyarie, naitɨ tamamata heimana huta mekaniyetuiriyarieni.   
\p
\v 41 Mɨkɨ rewitsixi naimekɨ mekaniyetuiriyarieni huta tewiyari heimana 'atahaika kiekari kwie mɨratihɨriwani heutinɨtɨkaime 'ixaheritsixi wakwieyaritsie.  
\v 42 Naitɨ kiekarite kaneixeiyatɨkateitɨni kwie mɨratihɨriwani heuyutinɨtɨkaime yu'aurie.   
\p
\v 43 Mɨpaɨ katiniuyurieni Yawé kaniwayetuirieni kwie 'ixaheritsixi naime keyeukame muwaruxatɨakai watutsima, 'Ixaheri xiɨyarimama mana mekutetɨ mekanakɨne.  
\v 44 Yawé kaniwarupitɨani memɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ, mɨpaɨ pɨreye'atɨa watutsima meripaitɨ kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ, nixewitɨ memɨwaraye'unie pɨkawara'iwaxɨ, Yawé muwarupitɨakɨ memɨwara'iwakɨ yunaime 'axamemɨwayurikukai.  
\v 45 Yawé kemɨtiwarutahɨawixɨ 'ixaheritsixi naime kanaye'atɨani nixeime tɨma pɨka'anayetɨmai, matsi peye'atɨa xexuime kemɨre'utɨkatei.   
\c 22  
\s1 Nuiwarite 'anutaɨyetari kememɨte'akunuaxɨa  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ Kutsuhexi Xuweni nuiwarimama, Kahari meta Manatsexi nuiwarimama hixɨapa memɨ'axe kaniwaruta'inieni,  
\v 2 hikɨ mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Xeme naime 'aitsika xepaye'atɨa Muitsexi mɨxeyetuiri, Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame. Yaxeikɨa, 'aitsika kenemɨtixeyetuiri xepeye'atɨa naime.  
\v 3 Ketemɨteheutewi hikɨ 'akuxi, xepɨkawaku'eiriwawe yu'iwama 'ixaheritsixi. Matsi xepeye'atɨa naime Yawé 'aitsikaya.  
\v 4 Hikɨta Yawé Kakaɨyari peye'atɨa kemɨtixe'utahɨawixɨ kwie puwayetuiri xe'iwama, hikɨta xekenakunuaxɨa yukie meta yukwietsie Muitsexi mɨxeyetuiri Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie.  
\v 5 Meta xekeneyutɨrɨkariyani xemeye'atɨanikɨ 'aitsika 'inɨari niukiyari, Muitsexi kemɨraka'utɨa Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame: Yawé yukakaɨyari xekenenaki'erieka, xekeneu'uwani kemɨtinake xekenaye'atɨaka 'aitsikaya, hamatɨana xekeneuhuni heitserie yu'iyarikɨ xeketene'uximayatsirieka meta naimekɨ yu'iyarikɨ 'aixɨa xeketeneyurieka».   
\p
\v 6 Mɨpaɨ 'utayɨka Kutsuhexi Kakaɨyari kaniutawawirieni 'aixɨa memɨ'itɨariekakɨ, kaniwareutanɨ'axɨani yukie.  
\v 7 Hixɨapa me'atɨ Manatsexi nuiwarimama, Muitsexi kaniwayetuiriekaitɨniri Watsani kwieyari, hipameta mɨkɨ xiɨyari Kutsuhexi kaniwayetuirieni 'anataɨye Kurutani tau makayuyuipike hepatsie, mana matsi mekanikuyaxe yuwaɨkawatɨ 'ixaheritsixi. Matɨari 'anutaɨyetari, Kutsuhexi kaniwarenɨ'ani yukie, Xuweni xiɨyarimama meta Kahari xiɨyarimama wahamatɨa 'aixɨa kaniwaruyurieni Kakaɨyari wawirietɨ,  
\v 8 mɨpaɨ 'utaitɨ: «Xekenakunuaxɨa yukie 'aixɨa mɨti'ane xetehexeiyatɨ: huru, pɨrata, wurunitse, tepɨate, waɨkawa yukemarite meta waɨkawa tewaxi. Yunaitɨ xeketeneyumikwani 'iwamarixi tita xemɨtewarenawairi temɨwaraye'unie».   
\p
\v 9 Hikɨ Xuweni meta Kahari waxiɨyarima meta hixɨapa me'atɨ manatsexi xiɨyarimama Tsiru mekanayekɨne Kanani kwieyaritsie, hakewa memeyuxeɨriekai yunaitɨ 'ixaheritsixi, mekanakunuaxɨani Karaha, kwie memɨyetuiriyariekaitsie 'aitsika kemainekai Yawé Muitsexi kemɨrahɨawekai.   
\p
\v 10 Kepauka memu'axɨa, Kurutani hatuxame tetsita 'akuxi Kanani kwieyaritsie, huta nuiwariyari hixɨata memɨ'axe 'imeriyu mawari taiyame mekaniutawewieni.  
\v 11 Hipatɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekatenetimani kename Xuweni nuiwarimama, meta Kahari nuiwarimama metatsiere hixɨapa me'atɨ Manatsexi nuiwarimama mawari taiyame me'utawewiekai, Kurutani hatetsita, 'ixaheritsixi wakwietsie.  
\v 12 Hikɨ yunaitɨ mekaniuyukuxeɨrieni Tsiru mewatakwinike huta 'imeriyu nuiwari.   
\p
\v 13 Mɨpaɨ mete'uxataka, 'ixaheritsixi Pinexi mekanenɨ'ani mawari wewiwamete wa'ukiyari 'Eriyatsaxi nu'aya Karaha kwieyaritsie mɨtixatamiekɨ.  
\v 14 Mɨkɨ hamatɨa mekaniuhukaitɨni tamamata yunaitɨ nuiwaritetsie memanuyetei 'Ixaheri xiɨyarimama memanuyetei.  
\v 15 Karaha me'u'axɨaka mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe huta 'imeriyu xiɨyariyari:   
\p
\v 16 ―Yunaitɨ Yawé hetsɨa memuyukuxexeɨriwa mepɨtemaiku, ¿titayari xete'iku'eiri 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari, titayari Yawé xekate'enie xete'iku'eiri, mawari taiyame titayari xete'utawewi?  
\v 17 ¿Kamɨtsɨ tixaɨtɨ tekatehetimaiwawe 'axaketemɨte'uyuri Pehuxi mɨreyetewatsie, 'akuxi 'aixɨa temɨkayuyuriwawe mɨkɨkɨ? ¿Kamɨtsɨ tekatemama ta'iwama yɨmɨiretɨ me'ukwikutɨtɨ?  
\v 18 ¿Titayari yaxeikɨa Yawé xekateheu'enie? Hikɨ xɨka xe'iku'eirieni mɨkɨ, 'uxa'a haxɨaya teyunaime 'ixaheritsixi tahetsie punuani.  
\v 19 Xɨka kwie xemanu'uwa kapatsieka 'ena pɨta xekeneu'axɨa Yawé kwieyatsie, meta mana tukieya manuwe. Xekeneu'axɨa 'ena tahamatɨa xemɨtitenikɨ, neuxei 'axaxepɨkateyurieka takakaɨyari hepaɨtsita meta tame tahepaɨtsita, xepitawewi mawari taiyame peru 'ari tepeixeiya mawari taiyame Yawé hetsiemieme.  
\v 20 Puyuri kepauka 'Akani Tsera nu'aya 'axamɨtiuyuri kepauka mɨtiunawa 'iya naime temɨtehauyehɨanikekai, Kakaɨyari haxɨaya tanaime tahetsie 'ixaheritsixi katiniunake. Yaxeketenemaika 'Akani xeikɨa pɨka'umɨ 'axamɨtiuyurikɨ.   
\p
\v 21 Xuweni xiɨyarimama meta Kahari xiɨyarimama metatsiere hixɨapa me'atɨ Manatsexi xiɨyarimama mɨpaɨ mekateniwarutahɨawe 'iya 'ixaheritsixi wa'ukiyarima:   
\p
\v 22 ―Yawé, Kakaɨyari mɨmariwe kakaɨyarixi wahɨxie, yurikɨ, Yawé, Kakaɨyari mɨmariwe kakaɨyarixi wahɨxie, mɨpaɨ pɨtimate kename 'axatekate'uyuri kename te'i'eirikutɨ tekayɨa. Xemetsiere 'ixaheritsixi yunaitɨ mɨpaɨ xeketenemaika. Mexɨka mɨpaɨ ka'aneni, 'aixɨa pɨ'ane xemɨtatsikwini.  
\v 23 Yawé tɨtɨ yaketatiutahɨawe xɨka tame tahetsiemieme te'itawewieni mawari taiyame temiku'eirienikɨ, yatɨ mana mawari temiwewiriekakɨ Muitsexi kemɨtiu'aitaxɨ.  
\v 24 Matsi tepitawewi 'uxa'atɨniwarie mieme. Tepeumama 'uxa'atɨniwarie xexiɨyarima tanuiwarima mɨpaɨ metewarutahɨawekɨ: “Yawé 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari xehetsie pɨkamieme,  
\v 25 xeme Xuweni meta Kahari nuiwarimama. Tame meta xeme teyuhamatɨa Yawé tahixɨapa hatuxame Kurutani puyete mana temɨka'anutakɨkanikɨ. Xeme heitserie xepɨkahexeiya Yawé xemahɨawenikɨ”. Xɨka mɨpaɨ tiɨyɨnike xeme xeniwema wahetsie pɨtinake xɨka taniwema mete'uhayewa Yawé me'ayexeiyatɨ.   
\p
\v 26 »'Ayumieme 'ikɨ teputawewi mawari taiyame, peru mawari taiyariyari wewiwame pɨkahɨkɨ meta hipame mawari wewiwame,  
\v 27 matsi pɨta mɨ'inɨaritɨnikɨ xehetsiemieme meta tahetsiemieme 'uxa'a warietɨni tukari mɨyehane, tameta yaxeikɨa tepɨyɨwawe Yawé temayexeiyanikɨ tukitana. Mɨpaɨ 'ayumieme xeniwema mepɨkayɨwawe mɨpaɨ memɨtewatahɨawekɨ tame xenuiwarima: “Xeme heitserie xepɨkahexeiya Yawé xemayexeiyanikɨ”.  
\v 28 'Ayumieme, mɨpaɨ 'aixɨa pɨ'ane xɨka 'uxa'a warietɨni mɨpaɨ xetate'utahɨawe yatɨni taniwema, tame mɨpaɨ tepɨtexe'eiya: “Xekeneuxeiya 'iya mawari taiyame Yawé hetsiemieme ta'ukiyarima memitawewi, mana temɨtetimawanikɨ pɨka'ayumieme, matsi mɨ'inɨaritɨnikɨ tahetsiemieme meta xehetsiemieme”.  
\v 29 Mɨyatɨtɨ mɨpaɨ pɨtimatsiɨkɨ tame Yawé tepɨkaku'eirieni, meta tepɨka'iku'eirieni mawari taiyame tetawewieme xeime pɨta, mawari taiyariyari wewiwame, hatsi mawariyari meta hipame mawari wewiwame, 'Ixuriki Tukiyari hɨxie 'uwekakutɨtɨ».   
\p
\v 30 Kepauka memu'enana xuwenitsixi meta karahitatsixi meta hixɨapa memɨ'axe Manatsexi xiɨyarimama, Pinexi mawari wewiwame meta wa'ukiyarima memanuyetei 'ixaheritsixi kememutiyua, mana kiekatari 'aixɨa mekateneka'erietɨkɨne.  
\v 31 Hikɨ Pinexi 'Eriyatsaxi nu'aya mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mɨkɨ nuiwarite:  
\p ―Hikɨ mɨpaɨ tepɨtemate Yawé tahamatɨa puyeika, xemetsɨ Yawé xepɨka'eirikukai, 'ayumieme xepɨtatsi'utawikweitsitɨa ketemɨtekwinitɨarienikekai.   
\p
\v 32 Hikɨ Pinexi mawari wewiwame 'Eriyatsaxi nu'aya meta memanuyetei 'ixaheritsixi wahetsie, mekaniwarutateutɨani karahitatsixi meta xuwenitsixi, mekanayekɨne Karaha mekaniuku'eirieni memakunuaxɨanikɨ Kanani kwieyaritsie memɨtewataxatɨanikɨ 'ixaheritsixi hipameta.  
\v 33 Mɨkɨ 'ixaheritsixi mekaniu'enanani 'aixɨa 'anemekɨ, 'aixɨa mekaniutiyuani yukakaɨyari hetsiemieme, mekateniuhayewa mewatakwinike yu'iwama mɨkɨ nuiwarite tau manatineika hepatsie memɨtama.   
\p
\v 34 Mɨkɨ xuwenitsixi meta karahitatsixi mɨkɨ mawari taiyame mekateniterɨwa: «'Inɨari», mɨpaɨ memutiyuakɨ: «Tahetsiemieme 'inɨari payani Yawé yuri Kakaɨyari mɨhɨkɨkɨ».   
\c 23  
\s1 Kutsuhexi kemɨtiutateutaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Muixa wiyari 'anuyeyaku Yawé 'ixaheritsixi kayuwatɨ kaniwarupitɨani kananeutsixi wahamatɨa, Kutsuhexi 'ukiratsitɨtɨri 'uxetɨ,  
\v 2 yunaime 'ixaheritsixi kaniwaruta'inieni, yunaime wa'ukiyarima, memanuyetei memɨtemaiwawe, 'itsɨkate meta waparewiwamete naime kiekaritetsie kiekatari, mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe: «Neri waɨkawa nekani'ukiratsitɨni, waɨkawa wiyari nekanexeiyani.  
\v 3 Xeme xekaniuneniere Yawé takakaɨyari kemɨtiuyuri hipame nuiwarite wahepaɨtsita xehetsiemieme, mɨkɨ kaniuyutamieni kepauka mɨtiyukwinekai xehetsiemieme.  
\v 4 Ne nekaniwayetuirieni 'inɨarikɨ mɨwahetsiemiemetɨnikɨ yuxexuime nuiwarite, tsepa meuyewetse hipame xemɨwara'iwakɨ 'akuxi meta haa manuyeka Kurutani haramara Meritexaniyu teme'iwaxɨ.  
\v 5 Yawé takakaɨyari kaniyɨweni xemɨwara'iwakɨ mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie, xeme xekwie kanayeimɨkɨ, mɨkɨ kemutayɨ.   
\p
\v 6 »'Ayumieme, xekenetɨrɨkawini xemeye'atɨanikɨ 'inɨari niukiyari Muitsexi kemɨraka'utɨa. Mɨkɨ 'inɨari niukiyari hawaikɨtɨma xepɨka'uku'e'eiriwani.  
\v 7 Xepɨka yuxewiriyani 'ena nuiwarite memuxuawe wahamatɨa. Wakakaɨyarixi xepɨkawarayexeiyani wahetsie xepɨkatewiyani meta wahetsiemieme xepɨkateyuhɨritɨaka.  
\v 8 Heitseriemekɨ xekeneu'uwani pɨta Yawé Kakaɨyari hɨxie, hikɨ kexemɨte'u'uwa hepaɨ.  
\v 9 Yawé kaniwarayeweiya 'iya nuiwarite memɨmamariwawekai memɨxe'aye'uniekai, hikɨ 'akuxi xewitɨ pɨkahe'iwawe.  
\v 10 Yuxewitɨtɨ xehetsɨa mieme xeimiriyari kaniwarutaweweiyani memɨxe'aye'unie, Yawé muyumienekɨ xehetsiemieme, mɨkɨ yukɨmana kemutayɨ.  
\v 11 Yaxeketeneuyuri kexemɨte'aitɨarie xeminaki'eriekakɨ Yawé yukakaɨyari.  
\v 12 Peru xɨka Kakaɨyari xe'uku'eirieni, xɨka hipame nuiwarite xewarutinɨni memu'uwa 'akuxi xetsata meta wahamatɨa xeyutinɨni xɨka xewarutiwitɨni,  
\v 13 mɨpaɨ matsi kexetenemaika Yawé Kakaɨyari pɨkawarayeweiya xetsata mɨkɨ nuiwarite. Matsi 'apɨta xewiniyari mepakɨne, meta 'iwaɨyɨ xehetsiemieme, xuya xehɨxita mieme, mepɨkaxehayewa kepaukake xeme xemakumawere 'ikɨ kwie 'aixɨa mɨ'ane Yawé mɨxeyetuiritsie.   
\p
\v 14 »Netsɨari, nekaniyemieximeniri kwitɨwa yunaitɨ teɨteri memɨtakukuwe memeukakɨkatsie. Xeme xekatenimaika naitɨ Yawé niukieya kanaye'axeni kemutayɨ yemekɨ. Naitɨ matsiɨkɨtɨ kanayeikani, mɨkɨ naimetsie yamɨtikamiekɨ.  
\v 15 Mɨpaɨtsiere keyamɨtikamie Yawé takakaɨyari kemutaine, mɨpaɨtsiere xehetsie 'uximatɨarika naime kanixe'upitɨaweni, kepaukake xemakumaweriyarieni 'ena kwiepa mɨxeyetuiritsie.  
\v 16 Xɨka xekaheye'atɨani Yawé yukakaɨyari tɨratuya kemɨtixeyetuiri, xɨka hipame pɨta kakaɨyarixi xewarayexeiyatɨ xehakɨne, mɨpaɨ yurikɨ xeketenemaika, Yawé haxɨaya xehetsie kaninuamɨkɨ, xekanakumaweriyariekuni kwie 'aixɨa mɨ'ane Yawé mɨxeyetuiritsie».   
\c 24  
\s1 Tsikenitsie tɨratu kememɨte'uwewi  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨte Kutsuhexi yunaime 'Ixaheri nuiwarimama kaniwarukuxeɨrieni Tsikeni mɨrakutewatsie. Kaniwaruta'inieni yunaime wa'ukiyarima, memanuyetei memɨtemaiwawe, 'itsɨkate meta waparewiwamete naime kiekaritetsie kiekatari. Yunaitɨ mekaniuyukuxeɨrieni Kakaɨyari hɨxie.  
\v 2 Kutsuhexi yunaime mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe mɨpaɨ katiniwaraye'eritɨani:  
\p ―Yawé mɨpaɨ kanaineni, 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari: Mɨixa wiyari panuyemie, xe'ukiyarima, Teraki niwemama 'Apɨrahami meta Nakuxi, 'Eupɨrate hatuxameyari 'anutaɨye mekaniu'uwakaitɨni, kakaɨyarixi hipame mekaniwarayexeiyakaitɨni.  
\v 3 Peru ne mana paitɨ 'Apɨrahami nepanayexei xetutsi hayeikame, Kanani nekaniyewitɨtɨyani, nuiwarimama memɨyumɨirenikɨ nekanipitɨani. Matɨari nekaniyetuirieni nu'aya xeime, 'Itsahaki,  
\v 4 meta 'Itsahaki nepiyetuiri yuhutame tɨɨri, Kakuwu meta 'Etsahu. Mɨkɨ 'Etsahu nekaniyetuirieni kwie hɨritsie Tsehixi mɨtitewa, Kakuwu meta niwemama 'Ekipitu mekanekɨne.   
\p
\v 5 »”Mɨixa wiyari 'anuyeyaku, nepɨwarenɨ'a Muitsexi meta 'Aruni, waɨkawa nepɨwaru'uximatɨa 'Ekipitu kiekatari, kepaukake xeme nemɨxehayewitɨni mana.  
\v 6 Kepauka nemɨwarayewitɨ xetutsima, xekaniu'axɨani Haramara Mɨxeta manuyeka, 'ekipitutari mekanixe'uweiyakaitɨni yukaxetate kuyaxa miemetetsie meta yukawayutsixi wahetsie me'utetɨ.  
\v 7 Xetutsima Yawé mekaniutahɨawe karima, mɨkɨ yɨriya punetɨa wahɨxie memɨkaxexeiyanikɨ, mɨkɨ haramara waheima kaniuyeurieni kaniwaranukanani. Xeme xemunenierixɨ xekanihɨkɨtɨni 'ekipitutari kenemɨwaruyuri. Mɨya tiɨyɨku xetutsima muixa wiyari mana mekaniu'uwakaitɨni makumawetsie.  
\v 8 Xeme nekanixe'atɨani 'amuxeutsixi wakwietsie, Kurutani 'anutaɨye tau manatineika hepatsie memɨtamakai. Kepauka memɨxe'utakwi nekaniwayetuani xehetsɨa, xeme xekaniuneniere kenemɨtiwaruka'unaxɨ, wakwie xekwie mayanikɨ.  
\v 9 Meta kepauka Waraki Tsipuxi nu'aya ti'aitame Muhawi kiekame mɨxetakwinikekai, mɨkɨ Warami puta'ini Wehuxi nu'aya, ne mɨnetsitawawirienikɨ xeme 'axanemɨxeyurienikɨ.  
\v 10 Peru ne Warami nepɨka'enimɨkɨkai, matsi 'aixɨa nepɨxe'uyuri pɨta mɨixamexɨa, mɨpaɨ ne nekatinixe'utawikweitsitɨani tɨrɨkariya kemɨrexeiyakai.  
\v 11 'Imatɨrieka, haa Kurutanitsie xekananukɨne Keriku xekaniye'axɨani, mɨkɨta mekanixe'utakwini. Yaxeikɨa mekaniuyɨni 'amuxeutsixi, peretseutsixi, kananeutsixi, 'etitsixi, keriketseutsixi, heweutsixi, meta kewutseutsixi. Peru ne nekaniwayetuani xehetsɨa xemɨwara'iwakɨ.  
\v 12 Xeme xepɨkate'uyuri, yu'ixiparakɨ meta yutupikɨ xemɨwara'iwaxɨ yuhutame te'aitamete 'amuxeutsixi, nepɨta nekatiniuyurieni nakatarixi nekaniwarenɨ'ani xehetsiemieme memɨwarayeweiyakɨ memɨxe'aye'unie.  
\v 13 Xemeta nekanixeyetuirieni kwie hetsiena xemɨkate'uximayakai meta kiekari xemɨka'itiwewi. Mɨkɨta xe'ayetetɨ xekanakɨne, kaxie takari xekwatɨ xepakɨ meta huriwu takari tsepa xemɨka'ika'ekai”.   
\p
\v 14 »'Ayumiemeta hikɨ, xeme xekeneyuyetua Yawé hetsɨa, xeketene'uximayatsirieka hetsiena xetewiyatɨ. Xekeniwaruku'eiri kakaɨyarixi xetutsima memɨwarayexeiyakai 'Eupɨrate 'anutaɨye paitɨ meta 'Ekipitu, Yawé xeikɨa xekenayexeiyani.  
\v 15 Peru xɨka xehetsiemieme 'axa'aneni Yawé mɨti'uximayatsirieka, xekeniwaranayexeiya kemɨ'ane xemɨwarayexeiyani, xetutsima memɨwarayexeiyakai 'Eupɨrate 'anutaɨye, yatɨni kakaɨyarixi 'amuxeutsixi memɨwarayexeiya, hikɨ 'ena wakwietsie xemanu'uwa. Tametsɨ, netɨɨriyama meta ne Yawé tepayexeiyani».   
\p
\v 16 Teɨteri mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Mɨpaɨ tame hatsuaku tepɨkayɨni. Tame Yawé tepɨkaku'eirieni, hipame kakaɨyarixi tewarayexeiyatɨ tepɨka'akɨne.  
\v 17 Yawé takakaɨyari tame meta tatutsima mɨtatsi'ayewitɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni 'Ekipitu kwieyaritsie, waɨriyarika temɨteha'uximayakaitsie. Mɨkɨ kanihɨkɨtɨni 'inɨari waɨkawa mamariwame muwewi tehenenierekaku. Katani'ɨwiyakaitɨni kepauka makumawetsie temu'uwakai meta kepauka yumɨireme nuiwarite wakwietsie temuyekɨkakaitsie.  
\v 18 Yawé kanihɨkɨtɨni muwarayewei yunaime 'ena memɨtitekai meta 'amuxeutsixi. 'Ayumieme tameta Yawé tepɨteta'uximayatsirieni, mɨkɨ takakaɨyari mɨhɨkɨkɨ.   
\p
\v 19 Hikɨ Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p ―Xeme xepɨkayɨwawe Yawé xemɨte'uximayatsirieka, mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari kanihɨkɨtɨni mɨpatsie meta Kakaɨyari mɨ'ɨtetsa. Pɨkatixeheuyehɨwirieni kepauka xe'eye'unietɨ xemakɨne meta kepauka 'axaxemɨteyurieni.  
\v 20 Xɨka xeme Yawé xe'uku'eirieni hipame pɨta kakaɨyarixi xetewa'uximayatsirieka, mɨkɨ kanixe'uximatɨamɨkɨ, kanixeta'unamɨkɨ yuheyemekɨ, tsepa 'aixɨa mutiuyuri xehetsiemieme.   
\p
\v 21 Peru teɨteri mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani tawarita:  
\p ―Tame hatsuaku mɨpaɨ tepɨkayɨni. Tame Yawé xeikɨa tepayexeiyani.   
\p
\v 22 Kutsuhexi tawarita mɨpaɨ katiniwarutahɨawe:  
\p ―Xemetɨtɨ xekanihɨkɨtɨni xemunenierixɨ kexemaitɨka kename Yawé xeikɨa xehayexeiyani.  
\p Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Huu, tame tepɨhɨme.   
\p
\v 23 Kutsuhexi mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p ―Xekeniwaruku'eiri kakaɨyarixi 'akuxi xemɨwarexeiya. Yu'iyarikɨ xekeneyuyetua Yawé hetsɨa, 'ixaheritsixi takakaɨyari.   
\p
\v 24 Tawarita teɨteri mɨpaɨ mekaniutiyuani:  
\p ―Yawé takakaɨyari xeikɨa tepayexeiyani, meta mɨkɨ xeikɨa tepeu'enieka.   
\p
\v 25 Mɨkɨ tukaritsie Kutsuhexi tɨratu kaniuhekwariya teɨteri 'ixaheritsixi wahetsiemieme. Mana tsiere Tsikeni kiekariyaritsie 'inɨari niukiyari kaniwarupitɨani yamemɨteyuriekakɨ, Kakaɨyari niukieyatɨme,  
\v 26 meta kaneka'utɨani, 'inɨari niukiyari Kakaɨyari hetsɨa mieme xapayaritsie. Hikɨ tete 'anekame kaniutituni xeime xiu hetɨa kaneikayeni, 'ixuriki tukiyari Yawé hetsiemieme manuwe hehurakaku.  
\v 27 Hikɨ 'ana mɨpaɨ kaniutayɨni:  
\p ―'Ikɨ tete 'inɨari pɨhɨkɨtɨni xehetsiemieme. Mɨkɨ yapɨretima naime niuki hepaɨtsita kepaɨmeme mɨtatsi'utaxatɨa Yawé hikɨ. Mɨkɨ xehetsiemieme pɨ'inɨaritɨni xɨka xeme yukakaɨyari xetehe'itaiyani.   
\p
\v 28 Mɨpaɨ tiuyurieka Kutsuhexi 'arike kaniwarenɨ'ani yukie yunaime teɨteri kememɨte'ukutetɨkatei.   
\s1 Mɨkɨ kwieyaritsie memukateukie  
\r (Kuts 24:29-31 – 'Its 2:6-9)  
\p
\v 29 Merikɨtsɨ yapaɨmexɨa tukari 'anukayaku Kutsuhexi kaniumɨni Nuni nu'aya, Yawé ti'uximayatsiriwame, xeitsienituyari heimana tamamata wiyari hexeiyatɨ.  
\v 30 Kaniukateukieni kwie mɨyetuiriyarietsie, Timinati-Tsera reyetewakaku, 'Epɨrahini hɨriyaritsie, Kahatsi hɨriyari yeta.  
\v 31 Kutsuhexi 'amuyeikakaitsie 'ixaheritsixi Yawé mekanayexeiyakaitɨni, mɨpaɨ tsiere katiniuyɨni kepauka 'amemu'uwakai Kutsuhexi memuparewi, memuhɨritɨrie mɨkɨ memunenierixɨ Yawé kemɨtiwaruparewi yuteɨterima.   
\p
\v 32 Kutse 'umeyarieya, 'ixaheritsixi 'Ekipitu paitɨ meheiyekweka, mekanikateuku Tsikeni paitɨ, kwie Kakuwu minanaitsie xeitsienituyari pɨrata tuminiyarikɨ Kamuxi niwemama wahetsɨa, Tsikeni mɨpaapayatɨkai. Mɨkɨ kwie 'ariketa Kutse nuiwarimama tiwapiini kanayani.   
\p
\v 33 'Imatɨrieka, 'Eriyatsaxi 'Aruni nu'aya kaniumɨni Kiweha paitɨ kaniukateukieni, yuniwe Pinexi kwieyatsie, 'Epɨrahini muhɨriyatsie.   